<H1>Tolkāppiyam -- Poruḷatikāram</H1>

<P>((Master file kept in: AA\AKAM\UTF2PDY\TOLK\TOL_P.HTM))
<P>((last modification: 2004 september 28th))


<H1>TP</H1>

<H2><A NAME="_TP1_">((1. akattiṇai iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_1">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_1">{SA TP1i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaikkiḷai mutalā+ peruntiṇai iṟuvāy
<li>muṟpaṭa+ kiḷanta eḻu tiṇai eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_2">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_2">{SA TP2i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṟṟuḷ,
<li>naṭuvaṇ aintiṇai naṭuvaṇatu oḻiya
<li>paṭu tirai vaiyam pāttiya paṇpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_3">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_3">{SA TP3i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mutal karu uripporuḷ eṉṟa mūṉṟē
<li>nuvalum kālai muṟai ciṟantaṉavē
<li>pāṭaluḷ payinṟavai nāṭum kālai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_4">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_4">{SA TP4i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mutal eṉappaṭuvatu nilam poḻutu iraṇṭiṉ
<li>iyalpu eṉa moḻipa iyalpu uṇarntōrē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_5">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_5">{SA TP5i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>māyōṉ mēya kāṭu uṟai ulakamum
<li>cēyōṉ mēya mai varai ulakamum
<li>vēntaṉ mēya tīm puṉal ulakamum
<li>varuṇaṉ mēya peru maṇal ulakamum
<li>mullai kuṟiñci marutam neytal eṉa+
<li>colliya muṟaiyāṉ collavumpaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_6">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_6">{SA TP6i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kār um mālai ~um mullai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_7">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_7">{SA TP7i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṟiñci,
<li>kūtir yāmam eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_8">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_8">{SA TP8i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>paṉi etir paruvamum urittu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_9">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_9">{SA TP9i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vaikaṟai viṭiyal marutam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_10">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_10">{SA TP10i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eṟpāṭu,
<li>neytal ātal mey peṟa+ tōṉṟum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_11">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_11">{SA TP11i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>naṭuvunilai+ tiṇaiyē naṇpakal vēṉiloṭu
<li>muṭivu nilai maruṅkiṉ muṉṉiya neṟittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_12">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_12">{SA TP12i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>piṉpaṉitāṉum urittu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_13">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_13">{SA TP13i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iru vakai+ pirivum nilai peṟa+ tōṉṟalum
<li>uriyatu ākum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_14">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_14">{SA TP14i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tiṇai mayakkuṟutalum kaṭi nilai ilavē
<li>nilaṉ oruṅku mayaṅkutal ila eṉa moḻipa
<li>pulaṉ naṉku uṇarnta pulamaiyōrē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_15">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_15">{SA TP15i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uripporuḷ allaṉa mayaṅkavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_16">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_16">{SA TP16i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>puṇartal pirital iruttal iraṅkal
<li>ūṭal avaṟṟiṉ nimittam eṉṟivai
<li>tērum kālai tiṇaikku uripporuḷē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_17">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_17">{SA TP17i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koṇṭu talaikkaḻitalum pirintu avaṇ iraṅkalum
<li>uṇṭu eṉa moḻipa ōr iṭattāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_18">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_18">{SA TP18i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kalanta poḻutum kāṭciyum aṉṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_19">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_19">{SA TP19i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mutal eṉappaṭuvatu āyiru vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_20">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_20">{SA TP20i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>teyvam uṇāvē mā maram puḷ paṟai
<li>ceyti yāḻiṉ pakutiyoṭu tokaii
<li>av vakai piṟavum karu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_21">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_21">{SA TP21i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>en nila maruṅkiṉ pū ~um puḷ= um
<li>an nilam poḻutoṭu vārā āyiṉum
<li>vanta nilattiṉ payatta ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_22">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_22">{SA TP22i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>peyar um viṉai ~um eṉṟu* āy iru vakaiya
<li>tiṇaitoṟum marīiya tiṇai nilai+ peyar ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_23">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_23">{SA TP23i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āyar vēṭṭuvar āṭūu+ tiṇai+ peyar
<li>āvayiṉ varūum kiḻavarum uḷarē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_24">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_24">{SA TP24i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēṉōr maruṅkiṉum eṇṇum kālai
<li>āṉā vakaiya tiṇai nilai+ peyarē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_25">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_25">{SA TP25i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭiyōr pāṅkiṉum viṉaivalar pāṅkiṉum
<li>kaṭivarai ila puṟattu eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_26">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_26">{SA TP26i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēval marapiṉ ēṉōrum uriyar
<li>ākiya nilaimai avarum aṉṉar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_27">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_27">{SA TP27i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ōtal pakaiyē tūtu ivai pirivē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_28">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_28">{SA TP28i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-28}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṟṟuḷ,
<li>ōtalum tūtum uyarntōr mēṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_29">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_29">{SA TP29i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-29}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tāṉē cēṟalum taṉṉoṭu civaṇiya
<li>ēṉōr cēṟalum vēntaṉ mēṟṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_30">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_30">{SA TP30i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-30}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mēviya ciṟappiṉ ēṉōr paṭimaiya
<li>mullai mutalā+ colliya muṟaiyāṉ
<li>piḻaittatu piḻaiyātu ākal vēṇṭiyum
<li>iḻaitta oṇ poruḷ muṭiyavum pirivē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_31">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_31">{SA TP31i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-31}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mēlōr muṟaimai nālvarkkum urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_32">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_32">{SA TP32i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-32}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṉṉar pāṅkiṉ piṉṉōr ākupa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_33">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_33">{SA TP33i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-33}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyarntōrkku uriya ōttiṉāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_34">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_34">{SA TP34i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-34}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēntu viṉai iyaṟkai vēntaṉ orīiya
<li>ēṉōr maruṅkiṉum eytu iṭaṉ uṭaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_35">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_35">{SA TP35i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-35}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poruḷvayiṉ piritalum avarvayiṉ urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_36">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_36">{SA TP36i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-36}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyarntōr poruḷvayiṉ oḻukkattāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_37">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_37">{SA TP37i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-37}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>munnīr vaḻakkam makaṭūuvoṭu illai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_38">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_38">{SA TP38i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-38}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ettiṇai maruṅkiṉum makaṭūu maṭalmēl
<li>poṟpuṭai neṟimai iṉmaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_39">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_39">{SA TP39i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-39}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṉṉum avaṉum avaḷum cuṭṭi
<li>maṉṉum nimittam moḻi+ poruḷ teyvam
<li>naṉmai tīmai accam cārtal eṉṟu
<li>aṉṉa piṟavum avaṟṟoṭu tokaii
<li>muṉṉiya kālam mūṉṟuṭaṉ viḷakki
<li>tōḻi tēettum kaṇṭōr pāṅkiṉum
<li>pōkiya tiṟattu naṟṟāy pulampalum
<li>ākiya kiḷaviyum av vaḻi uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_40">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_40">{SA TP40i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-40}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēma+ pērūr+ cēriyum curattum
<li>tāmē cellum tāyarum uḷarē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_41">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_41">{SA TP41i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-41}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ayalōr āyiṉum akaṟci mēṟṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_42">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_42">{SA TP42i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-42}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>talaivarum viḻuma nilai eṭuttu uraippiṉum
<li>pōkkaṟkaṇṇum viṭuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>nīkkaliṉ vanta tam uṟu viḻumamum
<li>vāymai ~um poymmai ~um kaṇṭōṟ cuṭṭi+
<li>tāy nilai nōkki+ talaippeyarttu+ koḷiṉum
<li>nōy mika+ peruki+ taṉ neñcu kaluḻntōḷai
<li>aḻintatu kaḷai eṉa moḻintatu kūṟi
<li>vaṉpuṟai neruṅki vantataṉ tiṟattoṭu
<li>eṉṟu ivai ellām iyalpuṟa nāṭiṉ
<li>oṉṟi+ tōṉṟum tōḻi mēṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_43">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_43">{SA TP43i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-43}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poḻutum āṟum uṭku vara+ tōṉṟi
<li>vaḻuviṉ ākiya kuṟṟam kāṭṭalum
<li>ūratu cārpum cellum tēyamum
<li>ārva neñcamoṭu ceppiya vaḻiyiṉum
<li>puṇarntōr pāṅkiṉ puṇarnta neñcamoṭu
<li>aḻintu etir kūṟi viṭuppiṉum āṅka+
<li>tāy nilai kaṇṭu taṭuppiṉum viṭuppiṉum
<li>cēy nilaikku akaṉṟōr celaviṉum varaviṉum
<li>kaṇṭōr moḻital kaṇṭatu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_44">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_44">{SA TP44i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-44}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oṉṟā+ tamariṉum paruvattu* um curattu* um
<li>oṉṟiya moḻiyoṭu valippiṉum viṭuppiṉum
<li>iṭai+ cura maruṅkiṉ avaḷ tamar eyti+
<li>kaṟpoṭu puṇarnta kauvai uḷappaṭa
<li>a+ pāl paṭṭa oru tiṟattāṉum
<li>nāḷatu ciṉmai ~um iḷamaiyatu arumai ~um
<li>tāḷāṉ pakkam um takutiyatu amaiti ~um
<li>iṉmaiyatu iḷivu* um uṭaimaiyatu uyarcci ~um
<li>aṉpiṉatu akalam um akaṟciyatu arumai ~um
<li>oṉṟāy+ poruḷvayiṉ ūkkiya pāliṉum
<li>vāyiṉum kaiyiṉum vakutta pakkamoṭu
<li>ūtiyam karutiya oru tiṟattāṉum
<li>pukaḻ um māṉam um eṭuttu vaṟpuṟuttal um
<li>tūtu iṭaiyiṭṭa vakaiyiṉāṉum
<li>āki+ tōṉṟum pāṅkōr pāṅkiṉum
<li>mūṉṟaṉ pakuti ~um maṇṭilattu arumai ~um
<li>tōṉṟal cāṉṟa māṟṟōr mēṉmai ~um
<li>pācaṟai+ pulampal um muṭinta kālattu+
<li>pākaṉoṭu virumpiya viṉaittiṟa vakaiyiṉum
<li>kāvaṟ pāṅkiṉ āṅkōr pakkam um
<li>parattaiyiṉ akaṟciyiṉ parintōṭ kuṟuki
<li>irattal um teḷittal um eṉa iru vakaiyoṭu
<li>urai+ tiṟa nāṭṭam kiḻavōṉ mēṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_45">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_45">{SA TP45i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-45}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eñciyōrkkum eñcutal ilavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_46">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_46">{SA TP46i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-46}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nikaḻntatu niṉaittaṟku ētuvum ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_47">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_47">{SA TP47i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-47}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nikaḻntatu kūṟi nilaiyalum tiṇaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_48">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_48">{SA TP48i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-48}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>marapunilai tiriyā māṭciya āki
<li>viravum poruḷum viravum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_49">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_49">{SA TP49i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-49}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uḷḷuṟai uvamam ēṉai uvamam eṉa+
<li>taḷḷātu ākum tiṇai uṇar vakaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_50">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_50">{SA TP50i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-50}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uḷḷuṟai teyvam oḻintatai nilam eṉa+
<li>koḷḷum eṉpa kuṟi aṟintōrē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_51">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_51">{SA TP51i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-51}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uḷḷuṟuttu itaṉoṭu ottu+ poruḷ muṭika eṉa
<li>uḷḷuṟuttu iṟuvatai uḷḷuṟai uvamam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_52">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_52">{SA TP52i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-52}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēṉai uvamam tāṉ uṇar vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_53">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_53">{SA TP53i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-53}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāmam cālā iḷamaiyōḷ vayiṉ
<li>ēmam cālā iṭumpai eyti
<li>naṉmai ~um tīmai ~um eṉṟu iru tiṟattāṉ
<li>taṉṉoṭu* um avaḷoṭu* um tarukkiya puṇarttu
<li>col etir peṟāaṉ colli iṉpuṟal
<li>pulli+ tōṉrum kaikkiḷai+ kuṟippu* ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_54">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_54">{SA TP54i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-54}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēṟiya maṭal tiṟam iḷamai tīr tiṟam
<li>tēṟutal oḻinta kāmattu miku tiṟam
<li>mikka kāmattu miṭaloṭu tokaii
<li>ceppiya nāṉkum peruntiṇai+ kuṟippē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_55">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_55">{SA TP55i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-55}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṉṉaiya nāṉkum muṉṉataṟku eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_56">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_56">{SA TP56i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-56}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāṭaka vaḻakkiṉ um ulakiyal vaḻakkiṉ um
<li>pāṭal cāṉṟa pulaṉeṟi vaḻakkam
<li>kali ~ē paripāṭṭu āy iru pāviṉ um
<li>uriyatu ākum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_57">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_57">{SA TP57i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-57}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>makkaḷ nutaliya akaṉ aim^ tiṇai ~um
<li>cuṭṭi oruvar+ peyar koḷa+ peṟāar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_58">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="akat.htm#_TPi_58">{SA TP58i}</A>
<TD>{N akatt-58}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>puṟattiṇai maruṅkiṉ poruntiṉ allatu
<li>akattiṇai maruṅkiṉ aḷavutal ilavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<HR>
<H2><A NAME="_TP2_">((2. puṟattiṇai iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_59">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_59">{SA TP59i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>akattiṇai maruṅkiṉ aril tapa uṇarntōr
<li>puṟattiṇai ilakkaṇam tiṟappaṭa+ kiḷappiṉ
<li>veṭci tāṉ ē kuṟiñciyatu puṟaṉ ē
<li>uṭku vara+ tōṉṟum īr-ēḻ tuṟaittu* ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_60">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_60">{SA TP60i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēntu viṭu muṉaiñar vēṟṟu+ pula+ kaḷaviṉ
<li>ā tantu ōmpal mēvaṟṟu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_61">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_61">{SA TP61i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>paṭai iyaṅku aravam pākkattu viricci
<li>puṭai keṭa+ pōkiya celavē puṭai keṭa
<li>oṟṟiṉ ākiya vēyē veyppuṟam
<li>muṟṟiṉ ākiya puṟattu iṟai muṟṟiya
<li>ūr kolai ā kōḷ pūcal māṟṟē
<li>nōy iṉṟu uyttal nuvalvaḻi+ tōṟṟam
<li>tantu niṟai pātīṭu uṇṭāṭṭu koṭai eṉa
<li>vanta īr-ēḻ vakaiyiṟṟu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_62">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_62">{SA TP62i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṟam kaṭaikkūṭṭiya kuṭinilai ciṟanta
<li>koṟṟavai nilaiyum a+ tiṇai+ puṟaṉ ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_63">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_63">{SA TP63i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>veṟi aṟi ciṟappiṉ vev vāy vēlaṉ
<li>veṟiyāṭṭu ayarnta kāntaḷum uṟu pakai
<li>vēntiṭai terital vēṇṭi ēntu pukaḻ
<li>pōntai vēmpē ār eṉa varūum
<li>mā perum tāṉaiyar malainta pūvum
<li>vāṭa vaḷḷi vayavar ēttiya
<li>ōṭā+ kaḻal-nilai uḷappaṭa ōṭā
<li>uṭal vēntu aṭukkiya uṉṉa nilaiyum
<li>māyōṉ mēya maṉ peruñ ciṟappiṉ
<li>tāvā viḻu+ pukaḻ+ pūvai nilaiyum
<li>ār amar ōṭṭalum ā peyarttu+ tarutalum
<li>cīr cāl vēntaṉ ciṟappu eṭuttu uraittalum
<li>talai+ tāḷ neṭumoḻi taṉṉoṭu puṇarttalum
<li>aṉaikku uri marapiṉatu karantai. aṉṟiyum
<li>varu tār tāṅkal vāḷ vāyttu+ kaviḻtal eṉṟu
<li>iru vakai+ paṭṭa piḷḷai nilaiyum
<li>vāḷ malaintu eḻuntōṉai makiḻntu paṟai tūṅka
<li>nāṭu avaṟku aruḷiya piḷḷaiyāṭṭum
<li>kāṭci kālkōḷ nīrppaṭai naṭutal
<li>cīrtta marapiṉ perumpaṭai vāḻttal eṉṟu
<li>iru-mūṉṟu marapiṉ kalloṭu puṇara+
<li>collappaṭṭa eḻu-mūṉṟu tuṟaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_64">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_64">{SA TP64i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vañcitāṉē mullaiyatu puṟaṉē
<li>eñcā maṇ nacai vēntaṉai vēntaṉ
<li>añcu taka+ talai+ ceṉṟu aṭal kuṟittaṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_65">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_65">{SA TP65i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyaṅku paṭai aravam eri parantu eṭuttal
<li>vayaṅkal eytiya perumaiyāṉum
<li>koṭuttal eytiya koṭaimaiyāṉum
<li>aṭuttu ūrntu aṭṭa koṟṟattāṉum
<li>mārāyam peṟṟa neṭumoḻiyāṉum
<li>poruḷiṉṟu uytta pērāṇ pakkamum
<li>varu vicai+ puṉalai+ kaṟ ciṟai pōla
<li>oruvaṉ tāṅkiya perumaiyāṉum
<li>piṇṭam mēya peruñcōṟṟu nilaiyum
<li>veṉṟōr viḷakkamum tōṟṟōr tēyvum
<li>kuṉṟā+ ciṟappiṉ koṟṟa vaḷḷaiyum
<li>aḻi paṭai taṭṭōr taḻiñciyoṭu tokaii
<li>kaḻi peruñ ciṟappiṉ tuṟai patiṉmūṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_66">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_66">{SA TP66i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uḻiñaitāṉē marutattu+ puṟaṉē
<li>muḻu mutal araṇam muṟṟalum kōṭalum
<li>aṉai neṟi marapiṟṟu ākum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_67">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_67">{SA TP67i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>atuvētāṉum iru-nāl vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_68">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_68">{SA TP68i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koḷḷār tēem kuṟitta koṟṟamum
<li>uḷḷiyatu muṭikkum vēntaṉatu ciṟappum
<li>tol eyiṟku ivartalum tōlatu perukkamum
<li>akattōṉ celvamum aṉṟiyum muraṇiya
<li>puṟattōṉ aṇaṅkiya pakkamum tiṟal paṭa
<li>oru tāṉ maṇṭiya kuṟumai ~um uṭaṉṟōr
<li>varu pakai pēṇār ār eyil uḷappaṭa
<li>collappaṭṭa nāl-iru vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_69">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_69">{SA TP69i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṭaiyum vāḷum nāḷkōḷ aṉṟi
<li>maṭai amai ēṇimicai mayakkamum kaṭaii+
<li>cuṟṟu amar oḻiya veṉṟu kai+ koṇṭu
<li>muṟṟiya mutirvum aṉṟi muṟṟiya
<li>akattōṉ vīḻnta nocciyum maṟṟu ataṉ
<li>puṟattōṉ vīḻnta putumaiyāṉum
<li>nīr+ ceru vīḻnta pāciyum atāaṉṟu
<li>ūr+ ceru vīḻnta maṟṟataṉ maṟaṉum
<li>matilmicaikku ivarnta mēlōr pakkamum
<li>ikal matil kuṭumi koṇṭa maṇṇumaṅkalamum
<li>veṉṟa vāḷiṉ maṇṇoṭu oṉṟa
<li>tokainilai eṉṉum tuṟaiyoṭu tokaii
<li>vakai nāl-mūṇṟē tuṟai eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_70">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_70">{SA TP70i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tumpaitāṉē neytalatu puṟaṉē
<li>maintu poruḷāka vanta vēntaṉai+
<li>ceṉṟu talai aḻikkum ciṟappiṟṟu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_71">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_71">{SA TP71i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṇai ~um vēl um tuṇaiyuṟa moyttaliṉ
<li>ceṉṟa uyiriṉ niṉṟa yākkai
<li>iru nilam tīṇṭā aru nilai vakaiyoṭu
<li>iru pāṟpaṭṭa oru ciṟappiṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_72">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_72">{SA TP72i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tāṉai yāṉai kutirai eṉṟa
<li>nōṉār uṭkum mū vakai nilaiyum
<li>vēl miku vēntaṉai moyttavaḻi oruvaṉ
<li>tāṉ mīṇṭu eṟinta tār nilai aṉṟiyum
<li>iruvar talaivar taputi+ pakkamum
<li>oruvaṉ oruvaṉai uṭai paṭai pukku
<li>kūḻai tāṅkiya erumai ~um paṭai aṟuttu
<li>pāḻi koḷḷum ēmattāṉum
<li>kaḷiṟu eṟintu etirntōr pāṭum kaḷiṟṟoṭu
<li>paṭṭa vēntaṉai aṭṭa vēntaṉ
<li>vāḷōr āṭum amalaiyum vāḷ vāyttu
<li>iru peru vēntar tāmum cuṟṟamum
<li>oruvarum oḻiya+ tokainilai+ kaṇṇum
<li>ceruvakattu iṟaivaṉ vīḻnteṉa ciṉaii
<li>oruvaṉ maṇṭiya nal icai nilaiyum
<li>pal paṭai oruvaṟku uṭaitaliṉ maṟṟavaṉ
<li>ōḷ vāḷ vīciya nūḻilum uḷappaṭa+
<li>pulli+ tōṉṟum paṉṉiru tuṟaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_73">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_73">{SA TP73i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vākaitāṉē pālaiyatu puṟaṉē
<li>tā il koḷkai+ tamtam kūṟṟai+
<li>pākupaṭa mikuti+ paṭuttal eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_74">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_74">{SA TP74i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṟu vakai+ paṭṭa pārppaṉa+ pakkam um
<li>ai vakai marapiṉ aracar pakkam um
<li>iru-mūṉṟu marapiṉ ēṉōr pakkam um
<li>maṟu il ceyti mūvakai+ kālam um
<li>neṟiyiṉ āṟṟiya aṟivaṉ tēyam um
<li>nāl-iru vaḻakkiṉ tāpata+ pakkam um
<li>pāl aṟi marapiṉ porunarkaṇ= um
<li>aṉai nilai vakaiyoṭu āṅku eḻu vakaiyāṉ
<li>tokai nilaipeṟṟatu eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_75">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_75">{SA TP75i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kūtir vēṉil eṉṟu iru pācaṟai+
<li>kātaliṉ oṉṟi+ kaṇṇiya vakaiyiṉum
<li>ērōr kaḷavaḻi aṉṟi kaḷavaḻi+
<li>tērōr tōṟṟiya veṉṟiyum tērōr
<li>veṉṟa kōmāṉ muṉtēr+ kuravai ~um
<li>oṉṟiya marapiṉ piṉtēr+ kuravai ~um
<li>perum pakai tāṅkum vēliṉāṉum
<li>arum pakai tāṅkum āṟṟalāṉum
<li>pullā vāḻkkai vallāṇ pakkamum
<li>ollār nāṇa periyavar+ kaṇṇi+
<li>colliya vakaiyiṉ oṉṟoṭu puṇarntu
<li>tol uyir vaḻaṅkiya avippaliyāṉum
<li>ollār iṭavayiṉ pulliya pāṅkiṉum
<li>pakaṭṭiṉāṉum āviṉāṉum
<li>tukaḷ tapu ciṟappiṉ cāṉṟōr pakkamum
<li>kaṭi maṉai nītta pāliṉkaṇṇum
<li>eṭṭu vakai nutaliya avaiyakkattāṉum
<li>kaṭṭu amai oḻukkattu+ kaṇṇumaiyāṉum
<li>iṭai il vaṇ pukaḻ+ koṭaimaiyāṉum
<li>piḻaittōr+ tāṅkum kāvalāṉum
<li>poruḷoṭu puṇarnta pakkattāṉum
<li>aruḷoṭu puṇarnta akaṟciyāṉum
<li>kāmam nītta pāliṉāṉum eṉṟu
<li>iru pāṟpaṭṭa oṉpatiṉ tuṟaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_76">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_76">{SA TP76i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāñcitāṉē peruntiṇai+ puṟaṉē
<li>pāṅku aruñ ciṟappiṉ pal āṟṟāṉum
<li>nillā ulakam pulliya neṟittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_77">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_77">{SA TP77i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>māṟṟa aruṅ kūṟṟam cāṟṟiya perumai ~um
<li>kaḻintōr oḻintōrkku+ kāṭṭiya mutumai ~um
<li>paṇpu uṟa varūum pakuti nōkki+
<li>puṇ kiḻittu muṭiyum maṟattiṉāṉum
<li>ēma+ cuṟṟam iṉṟi+ puṇṇōṟ
<li>pēey ōmpiya pēey+ pakkamum
<li>iṉṉaṉ eṉṟu iraṅkiya maṉṉaiyāṉum
<li>iṉṉatu piḻaippiṉ itu ākiyar eṉa+
<li>tuṉṉa aruñ ciṟappiṉ vañciṉattāṉum
<li>iṉ nakai maṉaivi pēey puṇṇōṉ
<li>tuṉṉutal kaṭinta toṭāa+ kāñciyum
<li>nītta kaṇavaṉ tīrtta vēliṉ
<li>pēetta maṉaivi āñciyāṉum
<li>nikarttu mēl vanta vēntaṉoṭu mutukuṭi
<li>makaṭpāṭu añciya makaṭpālāṉum
<li>mulai ~um mukaṉ um cērtti+ koṇṭōṉ
<li>talaiyoṭu muṭinta nilaiyoṭu tokaii
<li>īr-aintu ākum eṉpa. pēr icai
<li>māynta makaṉai+ cuṟṟiya cuṟṟam
<li>māynta pūcal mayakkattāṉum
<li>tāmē eytiya tāṅka arum paiyuḷum
<li>kaṇavaṉoṭu muṭinta paṭarcci nōkki+
<li>celvōr ceppiya mūtāṉantamum
<li>naṉi miku curattiṭai+ kaṇavaṉai iḻantu
<li>taṉi makaḷ pulampiya mutupālai ~um
<li>kaḻintōr tēettu+ kaḻi paṭar uṟīi
<li>oḻintōr pulampiya kaiyaṟu nilaiyum
<li>kātali iḻanta taputāra nilaiyum
<li>kātalaṉ iḻanta tāpata nilaiyum
<li>nallōḷ kaṇavaṉoṭu naḷi aḻal pukīi+
<li>col iṭaiyiṭṭa pālai nilaiyum
<li>māy peruñ ciṟappiṉ putalvaṟ payanta
<li>tāy tapa varūum talaippeyal nilaiyum
<li>malar talai ulakattu marapu naṉku aṟiya+
<li>palar cela+ cellā+ kāṭu vāḻttoṭu
<li>niṟai aruñ cirappiṉ tuṟai iraṇṭu uṭaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_78">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_78">{SA TP78i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāṭāṇ pakuti kaikkiḷai+ puṟaṉē
<li>nāṭum kālai nāl iraṇṭu uṭaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_79">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_79">{SA TP79i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>amararkaṇ muṭiyum aṟu vakaiyāṉum
<li>purai tīr kāmam pulliya vakaiyiṉum
<li>oṉṟaṉ pakuti oṉṟum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_80">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_80">{SA TP80i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vaḻakku* iyal maruṅkiṉ vakaipaṭa nilaii
<li>paraval um pukaḻcci ~um karutiya pāṅkiṉ um
<li>muṉṉōr kūṟiya kuṟippiṉum centuṟai
<li>vaṇṇa+ pakuti varaivu iṉṟu āṅkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_81">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_81">{SA TP81i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāma+ pakuti kaṭavuḷum varaiyār
<li>ēṉōr pāṅkiṉum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

