<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_82">{SA TP82i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuḻavi maruṅkiṉum kiḻavatu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_83">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_83">{SA TP83i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ūroṭu tōṟṟam um urittu eṉa moḻipa
<li>vaḻakkoṭu civaṇiya vakaimaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
