<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_84">{SA TP84i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mey+ peyar maruṅkiṉ vaittaṉar vaḻiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_85">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_85">{SA TP85i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koṭinilai kantaḻi vaḷḷi eṉṟa
<li>vaṭu nīṅku ciṟappiṉ mutalaṉa mūṉṟum
<li>kaṭavuḷ vāḻttoṭu kaṇṇiya varumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_86">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_86">{SA TP86i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-28}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koṟṟavaḷḷai ōr iṭattāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_87">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_87">{SA TP87i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-29}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koṭuppōr ētti+ koṭāar+ paḻittalum
<li>aṭuttu ūrntu ēttiya iyaṉmoḻi vāḻttum
<li>cēy varal varuttam vīṭa vāyil
<li>kāvalarkku uraitta kaṭainilaiyāṉum
<li>kaṇpaṭai kaṇṇiya kaṇpaṭai nilaiyum
<li>kapilai kaṇṇiya vēḷvi nilaiyum
<li>vēlai nōkkiya viḷakku nilaiyum
<li>vāyuṟai vāḻttum ceviyaṟivuṟūuvum
<li>āvayiṉ varūum puṟanilai vāḻttum
<li>kaikkiḷai vakaiyoṭu uḷappaṭa+ tokaii
<li>tokka nāṉkum uḷa eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_88">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="purat.htm#_TPi_88">{SA TP88i}</A>
<TD>{N puRat-30}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tāviṉ nal icai karutiya kiṭantōrkku+
<li>cūtar ēttiya tuyileṭai nilaiyum
<li>kūttarum pāṇarum porunarum viṟaliyum
<li>āṟṟiṭai+ kāṭci uṟaḻa+ tōṉṟi
<li>peṟṟa peru vaḷam peṟāarkku aṟivuṟīi
<li>ceṉṟu payaṉ etira+ coṉṉa pakkamum
<li>ciṟanta nāḷiṉil ceṟṟam nīkki
<li>piṟanta nāḷvayiṉ perumaṅkalamum
<li>ciṟanta cīrtti maṇṇumaṅkalamum
<li>naṭai mikuttu ēttiya kuṭai niḻal marapum
<li>māṇār+ cuṭṭiya vāḷmaṅkalamum
<li>maṉ eyil aḻitta maṇṇumaṅkalamum
<li>paricil kaṭaiiya kaṭaikkūṭṭu nilaiyum
<li>peṟṟa piṉṉarum peru vaḷaṉ ētti
<li>naṭaivayiṉ tōṉṟiya iru vakai viṭaiyum
<li>accam um uvakai ~um eccam iṉṟi
<li>nāḷum puḷḷum piṟavaṟṟiṉ nimittamum
<li>kālam kaṇṇiya ōmpaṭai uḷappaṭa
<li>ñālattu varūum naṭakkaiyatu kuṟippiṉ
<li>kālam mūṉṟoṭu kaṇṇiya varumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP3_">((3. kaḷavu iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_89">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_89">{SA TP89i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṉpamum poruḷum aṟaṉum eṉṟāṅku
<li>aṉpoṭu puṇarnta aintiṇai maruṅkiṉ
<li>kāma+ kūṭṭam kāṇum kālai
<li>maṟaiyōr tēettu maṉṟal eṭṭaṉuḷ
<li>tuṟai amai nal yāḻ+ tuṇaimaiyōr iyalpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_90">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_90">{SA TP90i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oṉṟē vēṟē eṉṟu iru pālvayiṉ
<li>oṉṟi uyarnta pālatu āṇaiyiṉ
<li>otta kiḻavaṉum kiḻāttiyum kāṇpa
<li>mikkōṉ āyiṉum kaṭi varai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_91">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_91">{SA TP91i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ciṟantuḻi aiyam ciṟantatu eṉpa
<li>iḻintuḻi iḻipē cuṭṭalāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_92">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_92">{SA TP92i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vaṇṭē iḻaiyē vaḷḷi pūvē
<li>kaṇṇē alamaral imaippē accam eṉṟu
<li>aṉṉavai piṟavum āṅkaṇ nikaḻa
<li>niṉṟavai kaḷaiyum karuvi eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_93">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_93">{SA TP93i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāṭṭam iraṇṭum aṟivu uṭampaṭuttaṟku+
<li>kūṭṭi uraikkum kuṟippurai ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_94">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_94">{SA TP94i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṟippē kuṟittatu koḷḷum āyiṉ
<li>āṅku avai nikaḻum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_95">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_95">{SA TP95i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>perumai ~um uraṉ um āṭūu mēṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_96">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_96">{SA TP96i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>accamum nāṇum maṭaṉum muntuṟutal
<li>niccamum peṇpāṟku uriya eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_97">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_97">{SA TP97i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēṭkai orutalai uḷḷutal melital
<li>ākkam ceppal nāṇu varai iṟattal
<li>nōkkuva ellām avaiyē pōṟal
<li>maṟattal mayakkam cākkāṭu eṉṟu i+
<li>ciṟappuṭai marapiṉavai kaḷavu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_98">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_98">{SA TP98i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṉṉilai ākkal colvaḻippaṭuttal
<li>nal nayam uraittal nakai naṉi uṟāa
<li>an nilai aṟital melivu viḷakkuṟuttal
<li>taṉ nilai uraittal teḷivu akappaṭuttal eṉṟu
<li>iṉṉavai nikaḻum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_99">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_99">{SA TP99i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mey toṭṭu+ payiṟal poy pārāṭṭal
<li>iṭam peṟṟu+ taḻāal iṭaiyūṟu kiḷattal
<li>nīṭu niṉaintu iraṅkal kūṭutal uṟutal
<li>colliya nukarcci vallē peṟṟuḻi+
<li>tīrā+ tēṟṟam uḷappaṭa+ tokaii
<li>pērā+ ciṟappiṉ iru-nāṉku kiḷaviyum
<li>peṟṟavaḻi makiḻcciyum pirintavaḻi+ kalaṅkalum
<li>niṟpavai niṉaii nikaḻpavai uraippiṉum
<li>kuṟṟam kāṭṭiya vāyil peṭpiṉum
<li>peṭṭa vāyil peṟṟu iravu valiyuṟuppiṉum
<li>ūrum pērum keṭutiyum piṟavum
<li>nīriṉ kuṟippiṉ nirampa+ kūṟi+
<li>tōḻiyai+ kuṟaiyuṟum pakutiyum tōḻi
<li>kuṟai avaṭ cārtti meyyuṟa+ kūṟalum
<li>taṇṭātu irappiṉum maṟṟaiya vaḻiyum
<li>col avaṭ cārttaliṉ pulliya vakaiyiṉum
<li>aṟintōḷ ayarppiṉ av vaḻi maruṅkiṉ
<li>kēṭum pīṭum kūṟalum tōḻi
<li>nīkkaliṉ ākiya nilaimaiyum nōkki
<li>maṭal mā kūṟum iṭaṉumār uṇṭē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_100">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_100">{SA TP100i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>paṇpiṉ peyarppiṉum parivuṟṟu meliyiṉum
<li>aṉpuṟṟu nakiṉum avaṭ peṟṟu maliyiṉum
<li>āṟṟiṭai uṟutalum av viṉaikku iyalpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_101">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_101">{SA TP101i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāṅkaṉ nimittam paṉṉiraṇṭu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_102">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_102">{SA TP102i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṉṉaiya mūṉṟum kaikkiḷai+ kuṟippē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_103">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_103">{SA TP103i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>piṉṉar nāṉkum peruntiṇai peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_104">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_104">{SA TP104i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mutaloṭu puṇarnta yāḻōr mēṉa
<li>taval aruñ ciṟappiṉ ain nilam peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_105">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_105">{SA TP105i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iru vakai+ kuṟi piḻaippu ākiya iṭattum
<li>kāṇā vakaiyiṉ poḻutu naṉi ikappiṉum
<li>tāṉ akam pukāaṉ peyartal iṉmaiyiṉ
<li>kāṭci ācaiyiṉ kaḷam pukku+ kalaṅki
<li>vēṭkaiyiṉ mayaṅki+ kaiyaṟu poḻutiṉum
<li>pukāa+ kālai+ pukku etirppaṭṭuḻi
<li>pakāa viruntiṉ pakutikkaṇṇum
<li>vēḷāṇ etirum viruppiṉkaṇṇum
<li>tāḷāṇ etirum piriviṉāṉum
<li>nāṇu neñcu alaippa viṭuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>varaital vēṇṭi+ tōḻi ceppiya
<li>purai tīr kiḷavi pulliya etirum
<li>varaivu uṭaṉpaṭutalum āṅku ataṉ puṟattu+
<li>purai paṭa vanta maṟuttaloṭu tokaii
<li>kiḻavōḷ mēṉa eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_106">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_106">{SA TP106i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāma+ tiṇaiyiṉ kaṇ niṉṟu varūum
<li>nāṇum maṭaṉum peṇmaiya ākaliṉ
<li>kuṟippiṉum iṭattiṉum allatu vēṭkai
<li>neṟippaṭa vārā avaḷvayiṉāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_107">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_107">{SA TP107i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāmam collā nāṭṭam iṉmaiyiṉ
<li>ēmuṟa iraṇṭum uḷa eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_108">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_108">{SA TP108i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>col etir moḻital arumaittu ākaliṉ
<li>alla kūṟṟumoḻi avaḷvayiṉāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_109">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_109">{SA TP109i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṟaintu avaṟ kāṇṭal taṟ kāṭṭuṟutal
<li>niṟainta kātaliṉ col etir maḻuṅkal
<li>vaḻipāṭu maṟuttal maṟuttu etirkōṭal
<li>paḻi tīr muṟuval ciṟitē tōṟṟal
<li>kaippaṭṭu+ kalaṅkiṉum nāṇu mika variṉum
<li>iṭṭu+ pirivu iraṅkiṉum arumai ceytu ayarppiṉum
<li>vantavaḻi eḷḷiṉum viṭṭu uyirttu aḻuṅkiṉum
<li>nontu teḷivu oḻippiṉum accam nīṭiṉum
<li>pirintavaḻi+ kalaṅkiṉum peṟṟavaḻi maliyiṉum
<li>varum toḻiṟku arumai vāyil kūṟiṉum
<li>kūṟiya vāyil koḷḷā+ kālaiyum
<li>maṉai+ paṭṭu+ kalaṅki+ citaintavaḻi+ tōḻikku
<li>niṉaittal cāṉṟa aru maṟai uyirttalum
<li>uyirā+ kālattu uyirttalum uyir cela
<li>vēṟṟu varaivu variṉ atu māṟṟutaṟkaṇṇum
<li>neṟi paṭu nāṭṭattu nikaḻntavai maṟaippiṉum
<li>poṟiyiṉ yātta puṇarcci nōkki
<li>orumai+ kēṇmaiyiṉ uṟu kuṟai teḷintōḷ
<li>arumai cāṉṟa nāl-iraṇṭu vakaiyiṉ
<li>perumai cāṉṟa iyalpiṉkaṇṇum
<li>poy talai aṭutta maṭaliṉkaṇṇum
<li>kaiyaṟu tōḻi kaṇṇīr tuṭaippiṉum
<li>veṟiyāṭṭu iṭattu veruviṉkaṇṇum
<li>kuṟiyiṉ oppumai maruṭaṟkaṇṇum
<li>varaivu talaivariṉum kaḷavu aṟivuṟiṉum
<li>tamar taṟ kātta kāraṇa maruṅkiṉum
<li>taṉ kuṟi taḷḷiya teruḷā+ kālai
<li>vantavaṉ peyarnta vaṟuṅ kaḷam nōkki+
<li>taṉ piḻaippāka+ taḻīi+ tēṟalum
<li>vaḻu iṉṟu nilaiiya iyaṟpaṭu poruḷiṉum
<li>poḻutum āṟum puraivatu aṉmaiyiṉ
<li>aḻivu talaivanta cintaikkaṇṇum
<li>kāmam ciṟappiṉum avaṉ aḷi ciṟappiṉum
<li>ēmam cāṉṟa uvakaikkaṇṇum
<li>taṉvayiṉ urimai ~um avaṉ vayiṉ parattai ~um
<li>aṉṉavum uḷavē ōr iṭattāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_110">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_110">{SA TP110i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>varaivu iṭai vaitta kālattu varuntiṉum
<li>varaiyā nāḷiṭai vantōṉ muṭṭiṉum
<li>urai eṉa+ tōḻikku uraittaṟkaṇṇum
<li>tāṉē kūṟum kālamum uḷavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_111">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_111">{SA TP111i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyiriṉum ciṟantaṉṟu nāṇē nāṇiṉum
<li>ceyir tīr kāṭci+ kaṟpu+ ciṟantaṉṟu eṉa+
<li>tollōr kiḷavi pulliya neñcamoṭu
<li>kāma+ kiḻavaṉ uḷvaḻi+ paṭiṉum
<li>tā il nal moḻi kiḻavi kiḷappiṉum
<li>āvakai piṟavum tōṉṟumaṉ poruḷē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_112">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_112">{SA TP112i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāṟṟamum tōṟṟamum oḻukkamum uṇṭiyum
<li>cey viṉai maṟaippiṉum celaviṉum payilviṉum
<li>puṇarcci etirppāṭu uḷḷuṟuttu varūum
<li>uṇarcci ēḻiṉum uṇarnta piṉṟai
<li>meyyiṉum poyyiṉum vaḻinilai piḻaiyātu
<li>pal vēṟu kavar poruḷ nāṭṭattāṉum
<li>kuṟaiyuṟaṟku etiriya kiḻavaṉai maṟaiyuṟa+
<li>perumaiyiṉ peyarppiṉum ulaku uraittu oḻippiṉum
<li>arumaiyiṉ akaṟciyum avaḷ aṟivuṟuttu+
<li>piṉ vā eṉṟalum pētaimai ūṭṭalum
<li>muṉ uṟu puṇarcci muṟai niṟuttu uraittalum
<li>añci accuṟuttalum uraittuḻi+ kūṭṭamoṭu
<li>eñcātu kiḷanta iru-nāṉku kiḷaviyum
<li>vanta kiḻavaṉai māyam ceppi+
<li>poṟutta kāraṇam kuṟitta kālaiyum
<li>puṇarntapiṉ avaṉvayiṉ vaṇaṅkaṟkaṇṇum
<li>kuṟaintu avaṭ paṭariṉum maṟaintavaḷ aruka
<li>taṉṉoṭum avaḷoṭum mutal mūṉṟu aḷaii
<li>piṉṉilai nikaḻum pal vēṟu maruṅkiṉum
<li>nal nayam peṟṟuḻi nayam puri iṭattiṉum
<li>eṇṇa arum pal nakai kaṇṇiya vakaiyiṉum
<li>puṇarcci vēṇṭiṉum vēṇṭā+ piriviṉum
<li>vēḷāṇ peru neṟi vēṇṭiya iṭattiṉum
<li>puṇarntuḻi uṇarnta aṟi maṭa+ ciṟappiṉum
<li>ōmpaṭai+ kiḷavi+ pāṅkiṉkaṇṇum
<li>ceṅ kaṭumoḻiyāṉ citaivu* uṭaittu āyiṉum
<li>eṉpu neka+ pirintōḷ vaḻi+ ceṉṟu kaṭaii
<li>aṉpu talaiyaṭutta vaṉpuṟaikkaṇ= um
<li>āṟṟatu tīmai aṟivuṟu kalakkam um
<li>kāppiṉ kaṭumai kaiyaṟa variṉum
<li>kaḷaṉ um poḻutu* um varai nilai vilakki
<li>kātal mikuti uḷappaṭa+ piṟa ~um
<li>nāṭu* um ūr um il= um kuṭi ~um
<li>piṟappu* um ciṟappu* um iṟappa nōkki
<li>avaṉ vayiṉ tōṉṟiya kiḷaviyoṭu tokaii
<li>aṉai nilai vakaiyāṉ varaital vēṇṭiṉum
<li>aiya+ ceykai tāykku etir maṟuttu
<li>poy eṉa māṟṟi meyvaḻi+ koṭuppiṉum
<li>avaṉ vilaṅkuṟiṉum kaḷam peṟa+ kāṭṭiṉum
<li>piṟaṉ varaivu āyiṉum avaṉ varaivu maṟuppiṉum
<li>muṉṉilai aṟaṉ eṉappaṭutal eṉṟu iru vakai+
<li>purai tīr kiḷavi tāyiṭai+ pukuppiṉum
<li>varaivu uṭaṉpaṭṭōṟ kaṭāval vēṇṭiṉum
<li>āṅku ataṉ taṉmaiyiṉ vaṉpuṟai uḷappaṭa
<li>pāṅkuṟa vanta nāl-eṭṭu vakai ~um
<li>tāṅku arum~ ciṟappiṉ tōḻi mēṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_113">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_113">{SA TP113i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaḷavu alar āyiṉum kāmam meyppaṭuppiṉum
<li>aḷavu mika+ tōṉṟiṉum talaippeytu kāṇiṉum
<li>kaṭṭiṉum kaḻaṅkiṉum veṟi eṉa iruvarum
<li>oṭṭiya tiṟattāṉ ceytikkaṇṇum
<li>āṭiya ceṉṟuḻi aḻivu talaivariṉum
<li>kātal kaimmikka kaṉaviṉ araṟṟalum
<li>tōḻiyai viṉavalum teyvam vāḻttalum
<li>pōkku uṭaṉ aṟintapiṉ tōḻiyoṭu keḻīi+
<li>kaṟpiṉ ākkattu niṟṟaṟkaṇṇum
<li>piriviṉ eccattum makaḷ neñcu valippiṉum
<li>iru pāl kuṭi+ poruḷ iyalpiṉkaṇṇum
<li>iṉṉa vakaiyiṉ patiṉmūṉṟu kiḷaviyoṭu
<li>aṉṉavai piṟavum cevili mēṉa.
</ol>
