<TD><A NAME="_TP_114">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_114">{SA TP114i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tāykkum varaiyār uṇarvu uṭampaṭiṉē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_115">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="kalavu.htm#_TPi_115">{SA TP115i}</A>
<TD>{N kaLav-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavōṉ aṟiyā aṟiviṉaḷ ivaḷ eṉa
<li>mai aṟu ciṟappiṉ uyarntōr pāṅkiṉ
<li>aiya+ kiḷaviyiṉ aṟitalum urittē.
</ol>
