<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP4_">((4. kaṟpu iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_140">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_140">{SA TP140i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṟpu eṉappaṭuvatu karaṇamoṭu puṇara
<li>koḷaṟku uri marapiṉ kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyai
<li>koṭaikku uri marapiṉōr koṭuppa koḷvatuvē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_141">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_141">{SA TP141i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koṭuppōr iṉṟiyum karaṇam uṇṭē
<li>puṇarntu uṭaṉ pōkiya kālaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_142">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_142">{SA TP142i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mēlōr mūvarkkum puṇartta karaṇam
<li>kīḻōrkku ākiya kālamum uṇṭē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_143">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_143">{SA TP143i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poyyum vaḻuvum tōṉṟiya piṉṉar
<li>aiyar yāttaṉar karaṇam eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_144">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_144">{SA TP144i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>karaṇattiṉ amaintu muṭinta kālai
<li>neñcu taḷai aviḻnta puṇarccikkaṇṇum
<li>eñcā makiḻcci iṟantu varu paruvattum
<li>añca vanta urimaikkaṇṇum
<li>nal neṟi+ paṭarum tol nala+ poruḷiṉum
<li>peṟṟa tēettu+ perumaiyiṉ nilaii
<li>kuṟṟam cāṉṟa poruḷ eṭuttu uraippiṉum
<li>nāma+ kālattu uṇṭu eṉa+ tōḻi
<li>ēmuṟu kaṭavuḷ ēttiya maruṅkiṉum
<li>allal tīra ārvamoṭu aḷaii
<li>colluṟu poruḷiṉkaṇṇum col eṉa
<li>ēṉatu cuvaippiṉum nī kai toṭṭatu
<li>vāṉōr amiḻtam puraiyum āl emakku eṉa
<li>aṭicil um pū ~um toṭutaṟkaṇ= um
<li>antaṇar tiṟattum cāṉṟōr tēettum
<li>antam il ciṟappiṉ piṟar piṟar tiṟattiṉum
<li>oḻukkam kāṭṭiya kuṟippiṉum oḻukkattu+
<li>kaḷaviṉuḷ nikaḻnta arumaiyai+ pulampi
<li>alamaral uḷḷamoṭu aḷaviya iṭattum
<li>antarattu eḻutiya eḻuttiṉ māṉa
<li>vanta kuṟṟam vaḻi keṭa oḻukalum
<li>aḻiyal añcal eṉṟu āyiru poruḷiṉum
<li>tāṉ avaṭ piḻaitta paruvattāṉum
<li>nōṉmai ~um perumai ~um mey koḷa aruḷi
<li>paṉṉal cāṉṟa vāyiloṭu porunti
<li>taṉṉiṉ ākiya takutikkaṇṇum
<li>putalvaṟ payanta puṉiṟu tīr poḻutiṉ
<li>ney aṇi mayakkam purintōḷ nōkki
<li>aiyar pāṅkiṉum amarar+ cuṭṭiyum
<li>cey peruñ ciṟappoṭu cērtaṟkaṇṇum
<li>payam keḻu tuṇai aṇai pulli pullātu
<li>uyaṅkuvaṉaḷ kiṭanta kiḻattiyai+ kuṟuki
<li>alkal muṉṉiya niṟai aḻi poḻutiṉ
<li>melleṉ cīraṭi pulliya iraviṉum
<li>uṟal aruṅkuraimaiyiṉ ūṭal mikuttōḷai+
<li>piṟa piṟa peṇṭiriṉ peyarttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>piriviṉ eccattu+ pulampiya iruvarai+
<li>pariviṉ nīkkiya pakutikkaṇṇum
<li>niṉṟu naṉi piriviṉ añciya paiyuḷum
<li>ceṉṟu kaiyikantu peyarttu uḷḷiya vaḻiyum
<li>kāmattiṉ valiyum kaiviṭiṉ accamum
<li>tāṉ avaṭ piḻaitta nilaiyiṉkaṇṇum
<li>uṭaṉ cēṟal ceykaiyoṭu aṉṉavai piṟavum
<li>maṭam paṭa vanta tōḻikkaṇṇum
<li>vēṟṟu nāṭṭu akalvayiṉ viḻumattāṉum
<li>mīṭṭu varavu āynta vakaiyiṉkaṇṇum
<li>av vaḻi+ perukiya ciṟappiṉkaṇṇum
<li>pēr icai ūrti+ pākar pāṅkiṉum
<li>kāmakkiḻatti maṉaiyoḷ eṉṟu ivar
<li>ēmuṟu kiḷavi colliya etirum
<li>ceṉṟa tēettu uḻappu naṉi viḷakki
<li>iṉṟi+ ceṉṟa taṉṉilai kiḷappiṉum
<li>arun toḻil muṭitta cemmal kālai
<li>viruntoṭu nallavai vēṇṭaṟkaṇṇum
<li>mālai ēntiya peṇṭirum makkaḷum
<li>kēḷir oḻukkattu+ pukaṟcikkaṇṇum
<li>ēṉaiya vāyilōr etiroṭu tokaii
<li>paṇ amai pakuti muppatiṉorumūṉṟum
<li>eṇṇa aruñ ciṟappiṉ kiḻavōṉ mēṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_145">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_145">{SA TP145i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṉ aṟivu āṟṟa aṟiyum ākaliṉ
<li>ēṟṟaṟ kaṇṇum niṟuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>urimai koṭutta kiḻavōṉ pāṅkil
<li>perumaiyiṉ tiriyā aṉpiṉkaṇṇum
<li>kiḻavaṉai makaṭūu+ pulampu peritu ākaliṉ
<li>alamaral perukiya kāmattu mikutiyum
<li>iṉpam um iṭumpai ~um ākiya iṭattum
<li>kayantalai tōṉṟiya kāmar neyyaṇi
<li>nayanta kiḻavaṉai neñcu puṇṇuṟīi
<li>naḷiyiṉ nīkkiya iḷi varu nilaiyum
<li>pukaṉṟa uḷḷamoṭu putuvōr cāyaṟku
<li>akaṉṟa kiḻavaṉai+ pulampu naṉi kāṭṭi
<li>iyaṉṟa neñcam talai+ peyarttu arukki
<li>etir peytu maṟutta īrattu maruṅkiṉum
<li>taṅkiya oḻukkattu+ kiḻavaṉai vaṇaṅki
<li>eṅkaiyarkku urai eṉa irattaṟkaṇṇum
<li>cellā+ kālai celka eṉa viṭuttalum
<li>kāma+ kiḻatti taṉ maka+ taḻīi
<li>ēmuṟu viḷaiyāṭṭu iṟutikkaṇṇum
<li>ciṟanta ceykai av vaḻi+ tōṉṟi
<li>aṟam puri uḷḷamoṭu taṉ varavu aṟiyāmai
<li>puṟam ceytu peyarttal vēṇṭu iṭattāṉum
<li>tantaiyar oppar makkaḷ eṉpataṉāl
<li>antam il ciṟappiṉ maka+ paḻittu neruṅkalum
<li>koṭiyōr koṭumai cuṭum eṉa oṭiyātu
<li>nal icai nayantōr colloṭu tokaii
<li>pakutiyiṉ nīṅkiya takutikkaṇṇum
<li>koṭumai oḻukkam kōṭal vēṇṭi
<li>aṭimēl vīḻnta kiḻavaṉai neruṅki
<li>kātal eṅkaiyar kāṇiṉ naṉṟu eṉa
<li>mātar cāṉṟa vakaiyiṉkaṇṇum
<li>tāyar kaṇṇiya nal aṇi+ putalvaṉai
<li>māya+ parattai uḷḷiya vaḻiyum
<li>taṉvayiṉ ciṟaippiṉum avaṉ vayiṉ pirippiṉum
<li>iṉṉā+ tol cūḷ eṭuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>kāmakkiḻattiyar nalam pārāṭṭiya
<li>tīmaiyiṉ muṭikkum poruḷiṉkaṇṇum
<li>koṭumai oḻukkattu+ tōḻikku uriyavai
<li>vaṭu aṟu ciṟappiṉ kaṟpiṉ tiriyāmai
<li>kāytalum uvattalum pirittalum peṭṭalum
<li>āvayiṉ varūum pal vēṟu nilaiyiṉum
<li>vāyiliṉ varūum vakaiyoṭu tokaii
<li>kiḻavōḷ ceppal kiḻavatu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_146">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_146">{SA TP146i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>puṇarntu uṭaṉ-pōkiya kiḻavōḷ maṉai iruntu
<li>iṭaiccurattu iṟaicci ~um viṉai ~um cuṭṭi
<li>aṉpuṟu takka kiḷattal tāṉ ē
<li>kiḻavōṉ cey-viṉaikku accam ākum.
</ol>
