<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_147">{SA TP147i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tōḻi uḷḷuṟutta vāyil pukuppiṉum
<li>āvayiṉ nikaḻum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_148">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_148">{SA TP148i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>peṟaṟku arum perum poruḷ muṭinta piṉ vanta
<li>teṟaṟku aru marapiṉ ciṟappiṉkaṇṇum
<li>aṟṟam aḻivu uraippiṉum aṟṟam illā+
<li>kiḻavōṭ cuṭṭiya teyva+ kaṭattiṉum
<li>cīruṭai+ perum poruḷ vaittavaḻi maṟappiṉum
<li>aṭaṅkā oḻukkattu avaṉvayiṉ aḻintōḷai
<li>aṭaṅka+ kāṭṭutaṟ poruḷiṉkaṇṇum
<li>piḻaittu vantu irunta kiḻavaṉai neruṅki
<li>iḻaittu āṅku ākki+ koṭuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>vaṇaṅku iyal moḻiyāṉ vaṇaṅkaṟkaṇṇum
<li>puṟampaṭu viḷaiyāṭṭu+ pulliya pukaṟciyum
<li>ciṟanta putalvaṉai+ tērātu pulampiṉum
<li>māṇ nalam tā eṉa vakuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>pēṇā oḻukkam nāṇiya poruḷiṉum
<li>cūḷvayiṉ tiṟattāl cōrvu kaṇṭu aḻiyiṉum
<li>periyōr oḻukkam peritu eṉa+ kiḷantu
<li>peṟu takai illā+ piḻaippiṉum av vaḻi
<li>uṟu takai illā+ pulaviyuḷ mūḻkiya
<li>kiḻavōḷpāl niṉṟu keṭuttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>uṇarppuvayiṉ vārā ūṭal uṟṟōḷvayiṉ
<li>uṇarttal vēṇṭiya kiḻavōṉpāl niṉṟu
<li>tāṉ vekuṇṭu ākkiya takutikkaṇṇum
<li>arumai+ kālattu+ perumai kāṭṭiya
<li>eḷimai+ kālattu irakkattāṉum
<li>pāṇar kūttar viṟaliyar eṉṟu ivar
<li>pēṇi+ colliya kuṟaiviṉai etirum
<li>nītta kiḻavaṉai nikaḻumāṟu paṭīiyar
<li>kātta taṉmaiyiṉ kaṇ iṉṟu peyarppiṉum
<li>piriyum kālai etir niṉṟu cāṟṟiya
<li>marapuṭai etirum uḷappaṭa piṟavum
<li>vakai paṭa vanta kiḷavi ellām
<li>tōḻikku uriya eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

