<li>illōr ceyviṉai ikaḻccikkaṇṇum
<li>pal vēṟu putalvar+ kaṇṭu naṉi uvappiṉum
<li>maṟaiyiṉ vanta maṉaiyōḷ ceyviṉai
<li>poṟai iṉṟu perukiya paruvaraṟkaṇṇum
<li>kātal cōrviṉ kaṭappāṭṭu āṇmaiyiṉ
<li>tāy pōl taḻīi+ kaḻaṟi am maṉaiviyai+
<li>kāyvu iṉṟu avaṉvayiṉ poruttaṟkaṇṇum
<li>iṉ nakai+ putalvaṉai+ taḻīi iḻai aṇintu
<li>piṉṉar vanta vāyiṟkaṇṇum
<li>maṉaiyōḷ ottaliṉ taṉṉōr aṉṉōr
<li>mikai eṉa+ kuṟitta koḷkaikkaṇṇum
<li>eṇṇiya paṇṇai eṉṟu ivaṟṟoṭu piṟavum
<li>kaṇṇiya kāmakkiḻattiyar mēṉa.
</ol>
