<li>piṟavum aṉṉa kiḻavōḷ māṇpukaḷ
<li>mukam pukal muṟaimaiyiṉ kiḻavoṟku uraittal
<li>akam pukal marapiṉ vāyilkaṭku uriya.
</ol>
