</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_179">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_179">{SA TP179i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-40}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavi muṉṉar+ taṟ pukaḻ kiḷavi
<li>kiḻavōṉ viṉaivayiṉ uriya eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_180">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_180">{SA TP180i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-41}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>moḻi etir moḻital pāṅkaṟku urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_181">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_181">{SA TP181i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-42}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṟittu etir moḻital aḵki+ tōṉṟum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_182">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_182">{SA TP182i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-43}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tuṉpuṟu poḻutiṉum ellām kiḻavaṉ
<li>vaṉpuṟuttallatu cēṟal illai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_183">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_183">{SA TP183i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-44}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>celaviṭai aḻuṅkal cellāmai aṉṟē
<li>vaṉpuṟai kuṟitta tavircci ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_184">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_184">{SA TP184i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-45}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavi nilaiyē viṉaiyiṭattu uraiyār
<li>veṉṟi+ kālattu viḷaṅki+ tōṉṟum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_185">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_185">{SA TP185i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-46}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pūppiṉ puṟappāṭu īr āṟu nāḷum
<li>nīttu akaṉṟu uṟaiyār eṉmaṉār pulavar
<li>parattaiyiṉ irinta kālaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_186">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_186">{SA TP186i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-47}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēṇṭiya kalvi yāṇṭu mūṉṟu iṟavātu.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_187">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_187">{SA TP187i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-48}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēntu uṟu toḻilē yāṇṭiṉatu akamē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_188">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_188">{SA TP188i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-49}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēṉai+ pirivum av iyal nilaiyum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_189">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_189">{SA TP189i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-50}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>yāṟum kuḷaṉum kāvum āṭi
<li>pati ikantu nukartalum uriya eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_190">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_190">{SA TP190i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-51}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāmam cāṉṟa kaṭaikkōṭ kālai
<li>ēmam cāṉṟa makkaḷoṭu tuvaṉṟi
<li>aṟam puri cuṟṟamoṭu kiḻavaṉum kiḻattiyum
<li>ciṟantatu payiṟṟal iṟantataṉ payaṉē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_191">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_191">{SA TP191i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-52}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tōḻi tāyē pārppāṉ pāṅkaṉ
<li>pāṇaṉ pāṭṭi iḷaiyar viruntiṉar
<li>kūttar viṟaliyar aṟivar kaṇṭōr
<li>yātta ciṟappiṉ vāyilkaḷ eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_192">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_192">{SA TP192i}</A>
<TD>{N kaRpu-53}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>viṉai vayiṉ pirintōṉ mīṇṭu varu kālai
<li>iṭaiccura maruṅkiṉ tavirtal illai
<li>uḷḷam pōla uṟṟuḻi utavum
<li>puḷ iyal kali mā uṭaimaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP5_">((5. poruḷ iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_193">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_193">{SA TP193i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>icai tirintu icaippiṉum iyaiyumaṉ poruḷē
<li>acai tirintu icaiyā eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_194">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_194">{SA TP194i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nōyum iṉpamum iru vakai nilaiyiṉ
<li>kāmam kaṇṇiya marapiṭai teriya
<li>eṭṭaṉ pakutiyum viḷaṅka oṭṭiya
<li>uṟuppuṭaiyatu pōl uṇarvuṭaiyatu pōl
<li>maṟuttu uraippatu pōl neñcoṭu puṇarttum
<li>collā marapiṉ avaṟṟoṭu keḻīi
<li>ceyyā marapiṉ toḻiṟpaṭuttu aṭakkiyum
<li>avar avar uṟu piṇi tama pōl cērttiyum
<li>aṟivum pulaṉum vēṟupaṭa niṟīi
<li>iru peyar mūṉṟum uriya āka
<li>uvamavāyil paṭuttalum uvamam
<li>oṉṟu iṭattu iruvarkkum uriya pāṟ kiḷavi.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_195">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_195">{SA TP195i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṉavum urittāl av iṭattāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_196">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_196">{SA TP196i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tāykkum urittāl pōkku uṭaṉ kiḷappiṉ.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_197">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_197">{SA TP197i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāl keḻu kiḷavi nālvarkkum urittē
<li>naṭpiṉ naṭakkai āṅku alaṅkaṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_198">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_198">{SA TP198i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyirum nāṇum maṭaṉum eṉṟu ivai
<li>ceyir tīr ciṟappiṉ nālvarkkum uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_199">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_199">{SA TP199i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vaṇṇam pacantu pulampuṟu kālai
<li>uṇarnta pōla uṟuppiṉai+ kiḻavi
<li>puṇarnta vakaiyān puṇarkkavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_200">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_200">{SA TP200i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uṭampum uyirum vāṭiyakkaṇṇum
<li>eṉ uṟṟaṉakol ivai eṉiṉ allatai
<li>kiḻavōṟ cērtal kiḻattikku illai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_201">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_201">{SA TP201i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru ciṟai neñcamoṭu ucāvum kālai
<li>uriyatākalum uṇṭu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_202">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_202">{SA TP202i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṉvayiṉ karattalum avaṉvayiṉ vēṭṭalum
<li>aṉṉa iṭaṅkaḷ al vaḻi ellām
<li>maṭaṉoṭu niṟṟal kaṭaṉ eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_203">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_203">{SA TP203i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṟattoṭu niṟkum kālattu aṉṟi
<li>aṟattu iyal marapu ilaḷ tōḻi eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_204">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_204">{SA TP204i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḷittal ēttal vēṭkai uraittal
<li>kūṟutal ucāatal ētīṭu talaippāṭu
<li>uṇmai ceppum kiḷaviyoṭu tokaii
<li>av eḻu vakaiya eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_205">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_205">{SA TP205i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uṟṟuḻi allatu collal iṉmaiyiṉ
<li>a+ poruḷ vēṭkai kiḻaviyiṉ uṇarpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_206">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_206">{SA TP206i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ceṟivum niṟaivum cemmaiyum ceppum
<li>aṟivum arumaiyum peṇpālāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_207">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_207">{SA TP207i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poḻutum āṟum kāppum eṉṟu ivaṟṟiṉ
<li>vaḻuviṉ ākiya kuṟṟam kāṭṭalum
<li>taṉṉai aḻitalum avaṇ ūṟu añcalum
<li>iraviṉum pakaliṉum nī vā eṉṟalum
<li>kiḻavōṉtaṉṉai vāral eṉṟalum
<li>naṉmaiyum tīmaiyum piṟitiṉai+ kūṟalum
<li>purai paṭa vanta aṉṉavai piṟavum
<li>varaital vēṭkai+ poruḷa eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_208">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_208">{SA TP208i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēṭkai maṟuttu+ kiḷantāṅku uraittal
<li>marīiya maruṅkiṉ urittu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_209">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_209">{SA TP209i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tērum yāṉaiyum kutiraiyum piṟavum
<li>ūrntaṉar iyaṅkalum uriyar eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_210">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_210">{SA TP210i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uṇṭaṟku uriya allā+ poruḷai
<li>uṇṭaṉa pōla+ kūṟalum marapē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_211">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_211">{SA TP211i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poruḷ eṉa moḻitalum varai nilai iṉṟē
<li>kāppu+ kaimmikutal uṇmaiyāṉa
<li>aṉpē aṟaṉē iṉpam nāṇoṭu
<li>tuṟanta oḻukkam paḻittu aṉṟu ākaliṉ
<li>oṉṟum vēṇṭā kāppiṉuḷḷē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_212">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_212">{SA TP212i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>curam eṉa moḻitalum varai nilai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_213">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_213">{SA TP213i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyarntōr kiḷavi vaḻakkoṭu puṇartaliṉ
<li>vaḻakku vaḻippaṭutal ceyyuṭku+ kaṭaṉ ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_214">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_214">{SA TP214i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṟa+ kaḻivu uṭaiyaṉa poruḷ+ payam paṭa variṉ
<li>vaḻakku* eṉa vaḻaṅkal um paḻittaṉṟu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_215">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_215">{SA TP215i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mikka poruḷiṉuḷ poruḷ vakai puṇarkka
<li>nāṇu+ talaippiriyā nalvaḻi+ paṭuttē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_216">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_216">{SA TP216i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṟaippeyar maruṅkiṉ keḻutakai+ potu+ col
<li>nilaikku uri marapiṉ iru vīṟṟum urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_217">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_217">{SA TP217i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tāyattiṉ aṭaiyā īya+ cellā
<li>viṉaivayiṉ taṅkā vīṟṟu+ koḷappaṭā
<li>em eṉa varūum kiḻamai+ tōṟṟam
<li>allāvāyiṉum pulluva uḷavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_218">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_218">{SA TP218i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru pāl kiḷavi eṉai+ pāṟkaṇ= um
<li>varu vakai tāṉē vaḻakku eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_219">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_219">{SA TP219i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ellā uyirkkum iṉpam eṉpatu
<li>tāṉ amarntu varūum mēvaṟṟu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_220">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_220">{SA TP220i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-28}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>parattai vāyil nālvarkkum urittē
<li>nila+ tiripu iṉṟu aḵtu eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_221">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_221">{SA TP221i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-29}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>orutalai urimai vēṇṭiṉum makaṭūu+
<li>pirital accam uṇmaiyāṉum
<li>ampalum alarum kaḷavu veḷippaṭukkum eṉṟu
<li>añca vanta āṅku iru vakaiyiṉum
<li>nōkkoṭu vanta iṭaiyūṟu poruḷiṉum
<li>pōkkum varaivum maṉaivikaṇ tōṉṟum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_222">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_222">{SA TP222i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-30}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>varutta mikuti cuṭṭum kālai
<li>urittu eṉa moḻipa vāḻkkaiyuḷ irakkam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_223">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_223">{SA TP223i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-31}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṉaivi uyarvum kiḻavōṉ paṇivum
<li>niṉaiyum kālai pulaviyuḷ uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_224">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_224">{SA TP224i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-32}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nikaḻ takai maruṅkiṉ vēṭkai mikutiyiṉ
<li>pukaḻ takai varaiyār kaṟpiṉuḷḷē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_225">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_225">{SA TP225i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-33}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṟaiccitāṉē uri+ puṟattatuvē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_226">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_226">{SA TP226i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-34}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṟaicciyiṉ piṟakkum poruḷumār uḷavē
<li>tiṟattu iyal maruṅkiṉ teriyumōrkkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_227">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_227">{SA TP227i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-35}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṉpuṟu takuvaṉa iṟaicciyuḷ cuṭṭalum
<li>vaṉpuṟai ākum varuntiya poḻutē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_228">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_228">{SA TP228i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-36}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>cey poruḷ accamum viṉaivayiṉ pirivum
<li>meypeṟa uṇarttum kiḻavi pārāṭṭē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_229">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_229">{SA TP229i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-37}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṟpuvaḻi+ paṭṭavaḷ parattaimai ēttiṉum
<li>uḷḷattu ūṭal uṇṭu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_230">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_230">{SA TP230i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-38}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavōḷ piṟaḷ kuṇam ivai eṉa+ kūṟi
<li>kiḻavōṉ kuṟippiṉai uṇartaṟkum uriyaḷ.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_231">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_231">{SA TP231i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-39}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tam uṟu viḻumam parattaiyar kūṟiṉum
<li>meymmaiyāka avarvayiṉ uṇarntum
<li>talaittāṭ kaḻaṟal tam etirppoḻutu iṉṟē
<li>malitalum ūṭalum avai alaṅkaṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_232">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_232">{SA TP232i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-40}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poḻutu talaivaitta kaiyaṟu kālai
<li>iṟanta pōla+ kiḷakkum kiḷavi
<li>maṭaṉē varuttam maruṭkai mikutiyoṭu
<li>avai nāṟ poruṭkaṇ nikaḻum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_233">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_233">{SA TP233i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-41}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>irantu kuṟaiyuṟṟa kiḻavaṉai+ tōḻi
<li>nirampa nīkki niṟuttal aṉṟiyum
<li>vāymai kūṟalum poy talaippeytalum
<li>nal vakaiyuṭaiya nayattiṉ kūṟiyum
<li>pal vakaiyāṉum paṭaikkavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_234">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_234">{SA TP234i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-42}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyar moḻi+ kiḷavi uṟaḻum kiḷavi
<li>aiya+ kiḷavi āṭūuviṟku urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_235">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_235">{SA TP235i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-43}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uṟukaṇ ōmpal taṉ iyalpu ākaliṉ
<li>uriyatākum tōḻikaṇ uraṉē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_236">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_236">{SA TP236i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-44}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyar moḻi+ kiḷaviyum uriyavāl avaṭkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_237">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_237">{SA TP237i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-45}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vāyiṟ kiḷavi veḷippaṭa+ kiḷattal
<li>tā iṉṟu uriya tamtam kūṟṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_238">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_238">{SA TP238i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-46}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uṭaṉuṟai uvamam cuṭṭu nakai ciṟappu eṉa+
<li>keṭal aru marapiṉ uḷḷuṟai aintē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_239">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_239">{SA TP239i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-47}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>antam il ciṟappiṉ ākiya iṉpam
<li>taṉvayiṉ varutalum vakutta paṇpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_240">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_240">{SA TP240i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-48}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṅkala moḻiyum vaiiya moḻiyum
<li>māṟu il āṇmaiyiṉ colliya moḻiyum
<li>kūṟiya maruṅkin koḷḷum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_241">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_241">{SA TP241i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-49}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ciṉaṉē pētaimai nimpiri nalkuravu
<li>aṉai nāl vakaiyum ciṟappoṭu varumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_242">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_242">{SA TP242i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-50}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṉṉai eṉṉai eṉṟalum uḷavē
<li>tol neṟi muṟaimai colliṉum eḻuttiṉum
<li>tōṉṟā marapiṉa eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_243">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_243">{SA TP243i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-51}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oppum uruvum veṟuppum eṉṟā
<li>kaṟpum ērum eḻilum eṉṟā
<li>cāyalum nāṇum maṭaṉum eṉṟā
<li>nōyum vēṭkaiyum nukarvum eṉṟu āṅku
<li>āvayiṉ varūum  kiḷavi ellām
<li>nāṭṭu iyal marapiṉ neñcu koḷiṉ allatu
<li>kāṭṭalākā+ poruḷa eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_244">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_244">{SA TP244i}</A>
<TD>{N poruL-52}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>imaiyōr tēettum eṟi kaṭal varaippiṉum
<li>avai il kālam iṉmaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP6_">((6. meyppāṭṭu iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_245">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_245">{SA TP245i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>paṇṇai+ tōṉṟiya eṇ nāṉku poruḷum
<li>kaṇṇiya puṟaṉē nāl nāṉku eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_246">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_246">{SA TP246i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāl iraṇṭu ākum pālumār uṇṭē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_247">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_247">{SA TP247i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nakaiyē aḻukai iḷivaral maruṭkai
<li>accam perumitam vekuḷi uvakai eṉṟu
<li>a+ pāl eṭṭē meyppāṭu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_248">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_248">{SA TP248i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḷḷal iḷamai pētaimai maṭaṉ eṉṟu
<li>uḷḷappaṭṭa nakai nāṉku eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_249">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_249">{SA TP249i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iḷivē iḻavē acaivē vaṟumai eṉa
<li>viḷivu il koḷkai aḻukai nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_250">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_250">{SA TP250i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mūppē piṇiyē varuttam meṉmaiyoṭu
<li>yāppuṟa vanta iḷivaral nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_251">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_251">{SA TP251i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>putumai perumai ciṟumai ākkamoṭu
<li>matimai cālā maruṭkai nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_252">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_252">{SA TP252i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṇaṅkē vilaṅkē kaḷvar tam iṟai eṉa+
<li>piṇaṅkal cālā accam nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_253">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_253">{SA TP253i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kalvi taṟukaṇ pukaḻmai koṭai eṉa+
<li>collappaṭṭa perumitam nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_254">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_254">{SA TP254i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uṟuppaṟai kuṭikōḷ alai kolai eṉṟa
<li>veṟuppiṉ vanta vekuḷi nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_255">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_255">{SA TP255i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>celvam pulaṉē puṇarvu viḷaiyāṭṭu eṉṟu
<li>allal nītta uvakai nāṉkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_256">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_256">{SA TP256i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āṅkavai oru pāl āka oru pāl
<li>uṭaimai iṉpuṟal naṭuvunilai aruḷal
<li>taṉmai aṭakkam varaital aṉpu eṉāa
<li>kaimmikal nalital cūḻcci vāḻttal
<li>nāṇutal tuñcal araṟṟu kaṉavu eṉāa
<li>muṉital niṉaital verūutal maṭimai
<li>karutal ārāycci viraivu uyirppu eṉāa
<li>kaiyāṟu iṭukkaṇ poccāppu poṟāmai
<li>viyarttal aiyam mikai naṭukku eṉāa
<li>ivaiyum uḷavē avai alaṅkaṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_257">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_257">{SA TP257i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>puku mukam purital poṟi nutal viyarttal
<li>naku nayam maṟaittal citaivu piṟarkku iṉmaiyoṭu
<li>taku muṟai nāṉkē oṉṟu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_258">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_258">{SA TP258i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kūḻai virittal kātu oṉṟu kaḷaital
<li>ūḻ aṇi taivaral uṭai peyarttu uṭuttaloṭu
<li>ūḻi nāṉkē iraṇṭu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_259">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_259">{SA TP259i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>alkul taivaral aṇintavai tiruttal
<li>il valiyuṟuttal iru kaiyum eṭuttaloṭu
<li>colliya nāṉkē mūṉru eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_260">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_260">{SA TP260i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pārāṭṭu eṭuttal maṭam tapa uraittal
<li>īram il kūṟṟam ēṟṟu alar nāṇal
<li>koṭuppavai kōṭal uḷappaṭa+ tokaii
<li>eṭutta nāṉkē nāṉku eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_261">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_261">{SA TP261i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>terintu uṭampaṭutal tiḷaippu viṉai maṟuttal
<li>karantiṭattu oḻital kaṇṭavaḻi uvattaloṭu
<li>poruntiya nāṉkē aintu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_262">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_262">{SA TP262i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>puṟam ceya+ citaital pulampi+ tōṉṟal
<li>kalaṅki moḻital kaiyaṟavu uraittaloṭu
<li>viḷampiya nāṉkē āṟu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_263">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_263">{SA TP263i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṉṉa piṟavum avaṟṟoṭu civaṇi
<li>maṉṉiya viṉaiya nimittam eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_264">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_264">{SA TP264i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>viṉai uyir melivu iṭattu iṉmaiyum urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_265">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_265">{SA TP265i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaiyum uḷavē avai alaṅkaṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_266">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_266">{SA TP266i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṉpattai veṟuttal tuṉpattu+ pulampal
<li>etir peytu parital ētam āytal
<li>paci aṭa niṟṟal pacalai pāytal
<li>uṇṭiyiṉ kuṟaital uṭampu naṉi curuṅkal
<li>kaṇ tuyil maṟuttal kaṉavoṭu mayaṅkal
<li>poyyā+ kōṭal meyyē eṉṟal
<li>aiyam ceytal avaṉ tamar uvattal
<li>aṟaṉ aḷittu uraittal āṅku neñcu aḻital
<li>em mey āyiṉum oppumai kōṭal
<li>oppuvaḻi uvattal uṟu peyar kēṭṭal
<li>nala+ taka nāṭiṉ kalakkamum atuvē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_267">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_267">{SA TP267i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṭṭuvayiṉ kaḻaṟal muṉivu meyn niṟuttal
<li>accattiṉ akaṟal avaṉ puṇarvu maṟuttal
<li>tūtu muṉivu iṉmai tuñci+ cērtal
<li>kātal kaimmikal kaṭṭurai iṉmai eṉṟu
<li>āyiru-nāṉkē aḻivu il kūṭṭam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_268">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_268">{SA TP268i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>teyvam añcal purai aṟam teḷital
<li>illatu kāytal uḷḷatu uvarttal
<li>puṇarntuḻi uṇmai poḻutu maṟuppu ākkam
<li>aruḷ mika uṭaimai aṉpu toka niṟṟal
<li>pirivu āṟṟāmai maṟaintavai uraittal
<li>puṟañcol māṇā+ kiḷaviyoṭu tokaii
<li>ciṟanta pattum ceppiya poruḷē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_269">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_269">{SA TP269i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>piṟappē kuṭimai āṇmai āṇṭoṭu
<li>uruvu niṟutta kāma vāyil
<li>niṟaiyē aruḷē uṇarvoṭu tiru eṉa
<li>muṟaiyuṟa+ kiḷanta oppiṉatu vakaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_270">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_270">{SA TP270i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nimpiri koṭumai viyappoṭu puṟamoḻi
<li>vaṉcol poccāppu maṭimaiyoṭu kuṭimai
<li>iṉpuṟal ēḻaimai maṟappoṭu oppumai
<li>eṉṟu ivai iṉmai eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_271">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="meyppati.htm#_TPi_271">{SA TP271i}</A>
<TD>{N meypp-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṇṇiṉum ceviyiṉum tiṇṇitiṉ uṇarum
<li>uṇarvuṭai māntarkku allatu teriyiṉ
<li>nal naya+ poruḷkōḷ eṇṇa aruṅkuraittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP7_">((7. uvama iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_272">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_272">{SA TP272i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>viṉai payaṉ mey uru eṉṟa nāṉkē
<li>vakai peṟa vanta uvama+ tōṟṟam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_273">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_273">{SA TP273i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>viraviyum varūum marapiṉa eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_274">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_274">{SA TP274i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyarntataṉ mēṟṟē uḷḷum kālai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_275">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_275">{SA TP275i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ciṟappē nalaṉē kātal valiyoṭu
<li>an nāl paṇpum nilaikkaḷam eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_276">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_276">{SA TP276i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻakkiṭu poruḷoṭu aintum ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_277">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_277">{SA TP277i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mutalum ciṉaiyum eṉṟu āyiru poruṭkum
<li>nutaliya marapiṉ uriyavai uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_278">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_278">{SA TP278i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>cuṭṭi+ kūṟā uvamam āyiṉ
<li>poruḷ etir puṇarttu+ puṇarttaṉa koḷalē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_279">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_279">{SA TP279i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uvamamum poruḷum ottal vēṇṭum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_280">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_280">{SA TP280i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poruḷē uvamam ceytaṉar moḻiyiṉum
<li>maruḷ aṟu ciṟappiṉ aḵtu uvamam ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_281">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_281">{SA TP281i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>perumaiyum ciṟumaiyum ciṟappiṉ tīrā+
<li>kuṟippiṉ varūum neṟippāṭu uṭaiya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_282">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_282">{SA TP282i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaitām,
<li>aṉṉa ēyppa uṟaḻa oppa
<li>eṉṉa māṉa eṉṟavai eṉāa
<li>oṉṟa oṭuṅka oṭṭa āṅka
<li>eṉṟa viyappa eṉṟavai eṉāa
<li>eḷḷa viḻaiya viṟappa nikarppa
<li>kaḷḷa kaṭuppa āṅkavai eṉāa
<li>kāyppa matippa takaiya maruḷa
<li>māṟṟa maṟuppa āṅkavai eṉāa
<li>pulla poruva poṟpa pōla
<li>vella vīḻa āṅkavai eṉāa
<li>nāṭa naḷiya naṭuṅka nanta
<li>ōṭa puraiya eṉṟavai eṉāa
<li>āṟu-āṟu avaiyum aṉṉa piṟavum
<li>kūṟum kālai+ pal kuṟippiṉavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_283">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_283">{SA TP283i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṉṉa āṅka māṉa viṟappa
<li>eṉṉa uṟaḻa takaiya nōkkoṭu
<li>kaṇṇiya eṭṭum viṉaippāl uvamam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_284">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_284">{SA TP284i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṉṉa eṉ kiḷavi piṟavoṭum civaṇum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_285">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_285">{SA TP285i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḷḷa viḻaiya pulla poruva
<li>kaḷḷa matippa vella vīḻa
<li>eṉṟu āṅku eṭṭē payaṉilai uvamam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_286">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_286">{SA TP286i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṭuppa ēyppa maruḷa puraiya
<li>oṭṭa oṭuṅka ōṭa nikarppa eṉṟu
<li>a+ pāl eṭṭē meyppāl uuvamam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_287">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_287">{SA TP287i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pōla maṟuppa oppa kāytta
<li>nēra viyappa naḷiya nanta eṉṟu
<li>ottu varu kiḷavi uruvin uvamam.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_288">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_288">{SA TP288i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tamtam marapiṉ tōṉṟumaṉ poruḷē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_289">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_289">{SA TP289i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāl iraṇṭu ākum pālumār uṇṭē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_290">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_290">{SA TP290i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>perumaiyum ciṟumaiyum meyppāṭu eṭṭaṉ
<li>vaḻi maruṅku aṟiya+ tōṉṟum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_291">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_291">{SA TP291i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uvama+ poruḷiṉ uṟṟatu uṇarum
<li>teḷi maruṅku uḷavē tiṟattu iyalāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_292">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_292">{SA TP292i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uvama+ poruḷai uṇarum kālai
<li>marīiya marapiṉ vaḻakkoṭu varum ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_293">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_293">{SA TP293i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iraṭṭaikkiḷavi iraṭṭai vaḻittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_294">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_294">{SA TP294i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>piṟitoṭu paṭātu piṟappoṭu nōkki
<li>muṉṉai marapiṉ kūṟum kālai
<li>tuṇivoṭu varūum tuṇiviṉōr koḷiṉē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_295">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_295">{SA TP295i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uvama+ pōli aintu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_296">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_296">{SA TP296i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taval aruñ ciṟappiṉ a+ taṉmai nāṭiṉ
<li>viṉaiyiṉum payattiṉum uṟuppiṉum uruviṉum
<li>piṟappiṉum varūum tiṟatta eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_297">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_297">{SA TP297i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavi colliṉ avaḷ aṟi kiḷavi.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_298">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_298">{SA TP298i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tōḻikku āyiṉ nilam peyarntu uraiyātu.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_299">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_299">{SA TP299i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-28}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavōṟku āyiṉ uraṉoṭu kiḷakkum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_300">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_300">{SA TP300i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-29}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēṉōrkku ellām iṭam varaivu iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_301">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_301">{SA TP301i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-30}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṉitu uṟu kiḷaviyum tuṉi uṟu kiḷaviyum
<li>uvama maruṅkiṉ tōṉṟum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_302">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_302">{SA TP302i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-31}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavōṭku uvamam īr iṭattu urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_303">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_303">{SA TP303i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-32}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavōṟku āyiṉ iṭam varaivu iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_304">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_304">{SA TP304i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-33}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tōḻiyum ceviliyum poruntuvaḻi nōkki+
<li>kūṟutaṟku uriyar koḷ vaḻiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_305">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_305">{SA TP305i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-34}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vēṟupaṭa vanta uvama+ tōṟṟam
<li>kūṟiya maruṅkiṉ koḷ vaḻi+ koḷāal.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_306">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_306">{SA TP306i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-35}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>orīi+ kūṟalum marīiya paṇpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_307">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_307">{SA TP307i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-36}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uvama+ taṉmai ~um urittu eṉa moḻipa
<li>payaṉilai purinta vaḻakkattāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_308">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_308">{SA TP308i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-37}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṭumāṟu uvamam kaṭi varai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_309">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="uvamai.htm#_TPi_309">{SA TP309i}</A>
<TD>{N uvama-38}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭukkiya tōṟṟam viṭuttal paṇpē
<li>niral niṟuttu amaittal niral-niṟai cuṇṇam
<li>varaṉ muṟai vanta mūṉṟu alaṅkaṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<HR>

<H2><A NAME="_TP8_">((8. ceyyuḷ iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_310">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_310">{SA TP310i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>māttirai eḻuttu iyal acai vakai eṉāa
<li>yātta cīrē aṭi yāppu eṉāa
<li>marapē tūkkē toṭai vakai eṉāa
<li>nōkkē pāvē aḷavu iyal eṉāa
<li>tiṇaiyē kaikōḷ kūṟṟu vakai eṉāa
<li>keṭpōr kaḷaṉē kāla vakai eṉāa
<li>payaṉē meyppāṭu ecca vakai eṉāa
<li>muṉṉam poruḷē tuṟai vakai eṉāa
<li>māṭṭē vaṇṇamoṭu yāppu iyal vakaiyiṉ
<li>āṟu talai iṭṭa an nāl-aintum
<li>ammai aḻaku toṉmai tōlē
<li>viruntē iyaipē pulaṉē iḻaipu eṉāa+
<li>porunta+ kūṟiya eṭṭoṭum tokaii
<li>nal icai+ pulavar ceyyuḷ uṟuppu eṉa
<li>vallitiṉ kūṟi vakuttu uraittaṉarē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_311">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_311">{SA TP311i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-02}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṟṟuḷ,
<li>māttirai vakaiyum eḻuttu iyal vakaiyum
<li>mēl kiḷantaṉavē eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_312">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_312">{SA TP312i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-03}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṟilē neṭilē kuṟil-iṇai kuṟil-neṭil
<li>oṟṟoṭu varutaloṭu mey+ paṭa nāṭi
<li>nērum niraiyum eṉṟiciṉ peyarē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_313">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_313">{SA TP313i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-04}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iru vakai ukaramoṭu iyaintavai variṉē
<li>nērpum niraipum ākum eṉpa
<li>kuṟil-iṇai ukaram al vaḻiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_314">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_314">{SA TP314i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-05}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyalacai mutal iraṇṭu ēṉavai uriyacai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_315">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_315">{SA TP315i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-06}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṉi+ kuṟil mutalacai moḻi citaintu ākātu.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_316">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_316">{SA TP316i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-07}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oṟṟu eḻuttu iyaṟṟē kuṟṟiyalikaram.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_317">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_317">{SA TP317i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-08}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṟṟiyalukaramum moḻi citaittu+ koḷāa
<li>niṟṟal iṉṟē īṟṟu aṭi maruṅkiṉum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_318">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_318">{SA TP318i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-09}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṟṟiyalukaramum muṟṟiyalukaramum
<li>oṟṟoṭu tōṉṟi niṟkavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_319">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_319">{SA TP319i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-10}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>acaiyum cīrum icaiyoṭu cērtti
<li>vakuttaṉar uṇarttal vallōr āṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_320">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_320">{SA TP320i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-11}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>īr acai koṇṭum mū acai puṇarttum
<li>cīr iyaintu iṟṟatu cīr eṉappaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_321">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_321">{SA TP321i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-12}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyalacai mayakkam iyaṟcīr ēṉai
<li>uriyacai mayakkam āciriya uriccīr.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_322">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_322">{SA TP322i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-13}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṉ nirai uṟiṉum aṉṉa ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_323">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_323">{SA TP323i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-14}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nēr avaṇ niṟpiṉ iyaṟcīr+ pāla.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_324">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_324">{SA TP324i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-15}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyalacai īṟṟu muṉ uriyacai variṉē
<li>niraiyacai iyala ākum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_325">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_325">{SA TP325i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-16}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḷapeṭai acainilai ākalum urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_326">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_326">{SA TP326i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-17}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oṟṟu aḷapeṭuppiṉum aṟṟu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_327">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_327">{SA TP327i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-18}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyaṟcīr iṟuti muṉ nēr avaṇ niṟpiṉ
<li>uriccīr veṇpā ākum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_328">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_328">{SA TP328i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-19}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vañci+ cīr eṉa vakai peṟṟaṉavē
<li>veṇ cīr allā mū acai eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_329">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_329">{SA TP329i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-20}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṉ pā al vaḻi tāṉ aṭaivu iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_330">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_330">{SA TP330i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-21}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vañci maruṅkiṉ eñciya uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_331">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_331">{SA TP331i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-22}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>veṇpā uriccīr āciriya uriccīr
<li>iṉ pā nēraṭikku oruṅku nilai ilavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_332">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_332">{SA TP332i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-23}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kalittaḷai maruṅkiṉ kaṭiyavum peṟāa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_333">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_333">{SA TP333i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-24}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kalittaḷai aṭivayiṉ nēr īṟṟu iyaṟcīr
<li>nilaikku urittaṉṟē teriyumōrkkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_334">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_334">{SA TP334i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-25}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vañci maruṅkiṉum iṟuti nillā.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_335">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_335">{SA TP335i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-26}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>icainilai niṟaiya niṟkuvatu āyiṉ
<li>acainilai varaiyār cīr nilai peṟavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_336">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_336">{SA TP336i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-27}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyaṟcīr+ pāṟpaṭuttu iyaṟṟiṉar koḷalē
<li>taḷai vakai citaiyā+ taṉmaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_337">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_337">{SA TP337i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-28}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>veṇcīr īṟṟacai niraiyacai iyaṟṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_338">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_338">{SA TP338i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-29}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṉ cīr iyaiya varukuvatu āyiṉ
<li>veṇcīr varaiyār āciriya aṭikkē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_339">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_339">{SA TP339i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-30}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>an nilai maruṅkiṉ vañci uriccīr
<li>oṉṟutal uṭaiya ōr oru vaḻiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_340">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_340">{SA TP340i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-31}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāṟ cīr koṇṭatu aṭi eṉappaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_341">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_341">{SA TP341i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-32}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭi uḷḷaṉavē taḷaiyoṭu toṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_342">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_342">{SA TP342i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-33}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭi iṟantu varutal il eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_343">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_343">{SA TP343i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-34}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭiyiṉ ciṟappē pāṭṭu eṉappaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_344">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_344">{SA TP344i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-35}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nāl eḻuttu āti āka āṟu eḻuttu
<li>ēṟiya nilattē kuṟaḷaṭi eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_345">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_345">{SA TP345i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-36}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēḻ eḻuttu eṉpa cintaṭikku aḷavē
<li>īr eḻuttu ēṟṟam av vaḻiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_346">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_346">{SA TP346i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-37}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pattu eḻuttu eṉpa nēraṭikku aḷavē
<li>otta nāl eḻuttu ēṟṟalaṅkaṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_347">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_347">{SA TP347i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-38}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mū-aintu eḻuttē neṭilaṭikku aḷavē
<li>īr eḻuttu mikutalum iyalpu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_348">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_348">{SA TP348i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-39}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mū-āṟu eḻuttē kaḻineṭiṟku aḷavē
<li>īr eḻuttu mikutalum iyalpu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_349">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_349">{SA TP349i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-40}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>cīr nilaitāṉē aintu eḻuttu iṟavātu
<li>nēr nilai vañcikku āṟum ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_350">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_350">{SA TP350i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-41}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḻuttu aḷavu eñciṉum cīr nilaitāṉē
<li>kuṉṟalum mikutalum il eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_351">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_351">{SA TP351i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-42}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyir il eḻuttum eṇṇappaṭāa
<li>uyir+ tiṟam iyakkam iṉmaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_352">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_352">{SA TP352i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-43}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vañci aṭiyē iru cīrttu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_353">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_353">{SA TP353i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-44}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṉ cīr eḻuttiṉ ciṉmai mūṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_354">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_354">{SA TP354i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-45}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mu+ cīrāṉum varum iṭaṉ uṭaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_355">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_355">{SA TP355i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-46}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>acai kūṉ ākum avvayiṉāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_356">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_356">{SA TP356i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-47}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>cīr kūṉ ātal nēraṭikku urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_357">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_357">{SA TP357i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-48}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aivakai aṭiyum virikkum kālai
<li>mey vakai amainta patiṉēḻ nilattum
<li>eḻupatu vakaiyiṉ vaḻu ila āki
<li>aṟunūṟṟu irupattaintu ākummē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_358">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_358">{SA TP358i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-49}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āṅkaṉam virippiṉ aḷavu iṟantaṉavē
<li>pāṅkuṟa uṇarntōr paṉṉum kālai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_359">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_359">{SA TP359i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-50}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aivakai aṭiyum āciriyakku uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_360">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_360">{SA TP360i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-51}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>virāay variṉum orūu nilai ilavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_361">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_361">{SA TP361i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-52}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taṉ cīr vakaiyiṉum taḷai nilai vakaiyiṉum
<li>iṉ cīr vakaiyiṉ aintu aṭikkum uriya
<li>taṉ cīr uḷvaḻi+ taḷai vakai vēṇṭā.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_362">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_362">{SA TP362i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-53}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>cīr iyai maruṅkiṉ ōr acai oppiṉ
<li>āciriya+ taḷai eṉṟu aṟiyal vēṇṭum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_363">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_363">{SA TP363i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-54}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṟaḷaṭi mutalā aḷavaṭi kāṟum
<li>uṟaḻ nilai ilavē vañcikku eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_364">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_364">{SA TP364i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-55}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḷavum cintum veḷḷaikku uriya
<li>taḷai vakai oṉṟā+ taṉmaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_365">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_365">{SA TP365i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-56}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḷavaṭi mikuti uḷappaṭa+ tōṉṟi
<li>iru neṭilaṭiyum kaliyiṟku uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_366">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_366">{SA TP366i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-57}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nirai mutal veṇcīr vantu nirai taṭpiṉum
<li>varai nilai iṉṟē av aṭikku eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_367">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_367">{SA TP367i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-58}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>virāaya taḷaiyum orūu nilai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_368">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_368">{SA TP368i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-59}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iyaṟcīr veḷḷaṭi āciriya maruṅkiṉ
<li>nilaikku uri marapiṉ niṟkavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_369">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_369">{SA TP369i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-60}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>veṇtaḷai viraviyum āciriyam viraviyum
<li>aiñ cīr aṭiyum uḷa eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_370">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_370">{SA TP370i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-61}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṟu cīr aṭiyē āciriya+ taḷaiyoṭu
<li>neṟi peṟṟu varūum nēraṭi muṉṉē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_371">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_371">{SA TP371i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-62}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḻu cīr aṭiyē muṭukiyal naṭakkum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_372">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_372">{SA TP372i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-63}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>muṭukiyal varaiyār mutal īr aṭikkum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_373">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_373">{SA TP373i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-64}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āciriya maruṅkiṉum veṇpā maruṅkiṉum
<li>mū vakai aṭiyum muṉṉutal ilavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_374">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_374">{SA TP374i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-65}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>īṟṟu ayal aṭiyē āciriya maruṅkiṉ
<li>tōṟṟam mu+ cīrttu ākum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_375">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_375">{SA TP375i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-66}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṭaiyum varaiyār toṭai uṇarvōrē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_376">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_376">{SA TP376i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-67}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mu+ cīr muraṟkaiyuḷ niṟaiyavum niṟkum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_377">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_377">{SA TP377i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-68}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vañci+ tūkkē centūkku iyaṟṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_378">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_378">{SA TP378i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-69}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>veṇpāṭṭu īṟṟu aṭi mu+ cīrttu ākum
<li>acai cīrttu ākum av vaḻiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_379">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_379">{SA TP379i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-70}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nēr īṟṟu iyaṟcīr niraiyum niraipum
<li>cīr ēṟṟu iṟūum iyaṟkaiya eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_380">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_380">{SA TP380i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-71}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nirai avaṇ niṟpiṉ nērum nērpum
<li>varaivu iṉṟu eṉpa vāy moḻi+ pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_381">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_381">{SA TP381i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-72}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḻu cīr iṟuti āciriyam kaliyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_382">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_382">{SA TP382i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-73}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>veṇpā iyaliṉum paṇpuṟa muṭiyum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_383">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_383">{SA TP383i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-74}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḻuttu mutalā īṇṭiya aṭiyiṉ
<li>kuṟitta poruḷai muṭiya nāṭṭal
<li>yāppu eṉa moḻipa yāppu aṟipulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_384">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_384">{SA TP384i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-75}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāṭṭu urai nūlē vāymoḻi piciyē
<li>aṅkatam mutucol av ēḻ nilattum
<li>vaṇ pukaḻ mūvar taṇ poḻil varaippiṉ
<li>nāṟ peyar ellai akattavar vaḻaṅkum
<li>yāppiṉ vaḻiyatu eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_385">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_385">{SA TP385i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-76}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>marapētāṉum,
<li>nāṟ col iyalāṉ yāppuvaḻi+ paṭṭaṉṟu.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_386">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_386">{SA TP386i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-77}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>akaval eṉpatu āciriyammē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_387">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_387">{SA TP387i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-78}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>atāaṉṟu eṉpa veṇpā yāppē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_388">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_388">{SA TP388i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-79}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tuḷḷal ōcai kali eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_389">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_389">{SA TP389i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-80}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tūṅkal ōcai vañci ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_390">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_390">{SA TP390i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-81}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maruṭpā ēṉai iru cār allatu
<li>tāṉ itu eṉṉum taṉinilai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_391">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_391">{SA TP391i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-82}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>av iyal allatu pāṭṭu āṅku+ kiḷavār.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_392">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_392">{SA TP392i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-83}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tūkku iyal vakaiyē āṅku eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_393">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_393">{SA TP393i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-84}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mōṉai etukai muraṇē iyaipu eṉa
<li>nāl neṟi marapiṉa toṭai vakai eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_394">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_394">{SA TP394i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-85}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḷapeṭai talaippeya aintum ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_395">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_395">{SA TP395i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-86}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>poḻippum orūuvum centoṭai marapum
<li>amaittaṉar teriyiṉ avaiyumār uḷavē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_396">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_396">{SA TP396i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-87}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>niral-niṟuttu amaittalum iraṭṭai yāppum
<li>moḻintavaṟṟu iyalāṉ muṟṟum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_397">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_397">{SA TP397i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-88}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭitoṟum talai eḻuttu oppatu mōṉai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_398">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_398">{SA TP398i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-89}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḵtu oḻittu oṉṟiṉ etukai ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_399">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_399">{SA TP399i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-90}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āyiru toṭaikkum kiḷaiyeḻuttu uriya.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_400">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_400">{SA TP400i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-91}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>moḻiyiṉum poruḷiṉum muraṇutal muraṇē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_401">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_401">{SA TP401i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-92}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṟuvāy oṉṟal iyaipiṉ yāppē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_402">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_402">{SA TP402i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-93}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḷapu eḻiṉ avaiyē aḷapeṭai+ toṭaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_403">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_403">{SA TP403i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-94}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru cīr iṭaiyiṭṭu etukai āyiṉ
<li>poḻippu eṉa moḻital pulavar āṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_404">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_404">{SA TP404i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-95}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iru cīr iṭaiyiṭiṉ orūu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_405">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_405">{SA TP405i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-96}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>colliya toṭaiyoṭu vēṟupaṭṭu iyaliṉ
<li>col iyaṟ pulavar atu centoṭai eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_406">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_406">{SA TP406i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-97}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mey peṟu marapiṉ toṭai vakaitāmē
<li>ai-īr āyirattu āṟu-aiññūṟṟoṭu
<li>toṇṭu talai iṭṭa pattu+ kuṟai eḻunūṟṟu
<li>oṉpaḵtu eṉpa uṇarnticiṉōrē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_407">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_407">{SA TP407i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-98}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>terintaṉar virippiṉ varampu ila ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_408">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_408">{SA TP408i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-99}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>toṭai vakai nilaiyē āṅku eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_409">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_409">{SA TP409i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-100}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>māttirai mutalā aṭinilai kāṟum
<li>nōkkutal kāraṇam nōkku eṉappaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_410">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_410">{SA TP410i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-101}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āciriyam vañci veṇpā kali eṉa
<li>nāl iyaṟṟu eṉpa pā vakai viriyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_411">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_411">{SA TP411i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-102}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>an nilai maruṅkiṉ aṟam mutal ākiya
<li>mum mutal poruṭkum uriya eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_412">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_412">{SA TP412i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-103}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pā viri maruṅkiṉai+ paṇpuṟa+ tokuppiṉ
<li>āciriyappā veṇpā eṉṟu āṅku
<li>āyiru pāvinuḷ aṭaṅkum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_413">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_413">{SA TP413i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-104}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āciriya naṭaittē vañci ēṉai
<li>veṇpā naṭaittē kali eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_414">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_414">{SA TP414i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-105}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vāḻttiyal vakaiyē nāṟpākkum urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_415">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_415">{SA TP415i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-106}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vaḻipaṭu teyvam niṉ puṟaṅkāppa
<li>paḻi tīr celvamoṭu vaḻi vaḻi ciṟantu
<li>polimiṉ eṉṉum puṟanilai vāḻttē
<li>kali nilai vakaiyum vañciyum peṟāa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_416">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_416">{SA TP416i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-107}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vāyuṟai vāḻttē avaiyaṭakkiyalē
<li>ceviyaṟivuṟūu eṉa avaiyum aṉṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_417">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_417">{SA TP417i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-108}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vāyuṟai vāḻttē vayaṅka nāṭiṉ
<li>vēmpum kaṭuvum pōla veñ col
<li>tāṅkutal iṉṟi vaḻi naṉi payakkum eṉṟu
<li>ōmpaṭai+ kiḷaviyiṉ vāyuṟuttaṟṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_418">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_418">{SA TP418i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-109}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaiyaṭakkiyalē aril tapa+ teriyiṉ
<li>vallā kūṟiṉum vakuttaṉar koṇmiṉ eṉṟu
<li>ellā māntarkkum vaḻi moḻintaṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_419">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_419">{SA TP419i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-110}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ceviyuṟaitāṉē,
<li>poṅkutal iṉṟi puraiyōr nāppaṇ
<li>avital kaṭaṉ eṉa+ ceviyuṟuttan
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_420">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_420">{SA TP420i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-111}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ottāḻicaiyum maṇṭila yāppum
<li>kuṭṭamum nēraṭikku oṭṭiṉa eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_421">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_421">{SA TP421i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-112}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kuṭṭam eruttaṭi uṭaittum ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_422">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_422">{SA TP422i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-113}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṇṭilam kuṭṭam eṉṟu ivai iraṇṭum
<li>centūkku iyala eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_423">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_423">{SA TP423i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-114}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>neṭuveṇpāṭṭē kuṟuveṇpāṭṭē
<li>kaikkiḷai paripāṭṭu aṅkata+ ceyyuḷoṭu
<li>ottavai ellām veṇpā yāppiṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_424">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_424">{SA TP424i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-115}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaikkiḷaitāṉē veṇpā āki
<li>āciriya iyalāṉ muṭiyavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_425">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_425">{SA TP425i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-116}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>paripāṭallē tokai nilai vakaiyiṉ
<li>itu pā eṉṉum iyal neṟi iṉṟi
<li>potuvāy niṟṟaṟkum urittu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_426">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_426">{SA TP426i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-117}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koccakam arākam curitakam eruttoṭu
<li>ceppiya nāṉkum taṉakku uṟuppu āka
<li>kāmam kaṇṇiya nilaimaittu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_427">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_427">{SA TP427i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-118}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>coṟcīr aṭiyum muṭukiyal aṭiyum
<li>a+ pā nilaimaikku uriya ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_428">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_428">{SA TP428i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-119}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaṭṭurai vakaiyāṉ eṇṇoṭu puṇarntum
<li>muṭṭaṭi iṉṟi+ kuṟaivu cīrttu ākiyum
<li>moḻi acai ākiyum vaḻi-acai puṇarntum
<li>coṟcīrttu iṟutal coṟcīrkku iyalpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_429">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_429">{SA TP429i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-120}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṅkatamtāṉē aril tapa+ teriyiṉ
<li>cemporuḷ karantatu eṉa iru vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_430">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_430">{SA TP430i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-121}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>cemporuḷ āyiṉa vacai eṉappaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_431">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_431">{SA TP431i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-122}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>moḻi karantu moḻiyiṉ atu paḻikarappu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_432">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_432">{SA TP432i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-123}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ceyyuḷtāmē iraṇṭu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_433">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_433">{SA TP433i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-124}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>tukaḷoṭum poruḷoṭum puṇarntaṉṟu āyiṉ
<li>ceviyuṟai+ ceyyuḷ eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_434">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_434">{SA TP434i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-125}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vacaiyoṭum nacaiyoṭum puṇarntaṉṟu āyiṉ
<li>aṅkata+ ceyyuḷ eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_435">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_435">{SA TP435i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-126}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ottāḻicaikkali kaliveṇpāṭṭē
<li>koccakam uṟaḻoṭu kali nāl vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_436">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_436">{SA TP436i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-127}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṟṟuḷ,
<li>ottāḻicaikkali iru vakaittu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_437">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_437">{SA TP437i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-128}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṭainilaippāṭṭē taravu pōkku aṭai eṉa
<li>naṭai naviṉṟu oḻukum oṉṟu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_438">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_438">{SA TP438i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-129}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taravētāṉum nāl aṭi iḻipu āy
<li>āṟu-iraṇṭu uyarvum piṟavum peṟumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_439">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_439">{SA TP439i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-130}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṭainilaippāṭṭē,
<li>taravu akappaṭṭa marapiṉatu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_440">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_440">{SA TP440i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-131}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭai nilai+ kiḷavi tāḻicai+ piṉṉar
<li>naṭai naviṉṟu oḻukum āṅku eṉ kiḷavi.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_441">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_441">{SA TP441i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-132}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pōkku iyal vakaiyē vaippu eṉappaṭumē
<li>taravu iyal ottum ataṉ akappaṭumē
<li>purai tīr iṟuti nilaiyuraittaṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_442">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_442">{SA TP442i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-133}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ēṉai oṉṟē,
<li>tēvar+ parāaya muṉṉilaikkaṇṇē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_443">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_443">{SA TP443i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-134}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>atuvē,
<li>vaṇṇakam orupōku eṉa iru vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_444">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_444">{SA TP444i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-135}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vaṇṇakamtāṉē,
<li>taravē tāḻicai eṇṇē vāram eṉṟu
<li>an nāl vakaiyiṉ tōṉṟum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_445">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_445">{SA TP445i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-136}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taravētāṉum,
<li>nāṉkum āṟum eṭṭum eṉṟa
<li>nēraṭi paṟṟiya nilaimaittu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_446">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_446">{SA TP446i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-137}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ottu mūṉṟu ākum ottāḻicaiyē
<li>taraviṉ curuṅki+ tōṉṟum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_447">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_447">{SA TP447i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-138}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭakku iyal vāram taravoṭu okkum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_448">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_448">{SA TP448i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-139}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mutal toṭai peruki+ curuṅkumaṉ eṇṇē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_449">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_449">{SA TP449i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-140}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eṇ iṭai oḻital ētam iṉṟē
<li>ciṉṉam allā+ kālaiyāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_450">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_450">{SA TP450i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-141}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>orupōku iyaṟkaiyum iru vakaittu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_451">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_451">{SA TP451i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-142}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>koccaka orupōku ampōtaraṅkam eṉṟu
<li>oppa nāṭi uṇartal vēṇṭum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_452">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_452">{SA TP452i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-143}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taravu iṉṟu āki+ tāḻicai peṟṟum
<li>tāḻicai iṉṟi+ taravu uṭaittu ākiyum
<li>eṇ iṭai iṭṭu+ ciṉṉam kuṉṟiyum
<li>aṭakkiyal iṉṟi aṭi nimirntu oḻukiyum
<li>yāppiṉum poruḷiṉum vēṟṟumai uṭaiyatu
<li>koccaka orupōku ākum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_453">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_453">{SA TP453i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-144}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>orupāṉ ciṟumai iraṭṭi ataṉ uyarpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_454">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_454">{SA TP454i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-145}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ampōtaraṅkam aṟupatiṟṟu aṭittē
<li>cempāl vāram ciṟumaikku ellai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_455">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_455">{SA TP455i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-146}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eruttē koccakam arākam ciṟṟeṇ
<li>aṭakkiyal vāramoṭu an nilaikku urittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_456">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_456">{SA TP456i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-147}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru poruḷ nutaliya veḷḷaṭi iyalāṉ
<li>tiripu iṉṟi varuvatu kaliveṇpāṭṭē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_457">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_457">{SA TP457i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-148}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>taravum pōkkum pāṭṭu iṭai miṭaintum
<li>aiñ cīr aṭukkiyum āṟu mey peṟṟum
<li>veṇpā iyalāṉ veḷippaṭa+ tōṉṟum
<li>pānilai vakaiyē koccaka+ kali eṉa
<li>nūl navil pulavar nuvaṉṟu aṟaintaṉarē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_458">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_458">{SA TP458i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-149}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kūṟṟum māṟṟamum iṭai iṭai miṭaintum
<li>pōkku iṉṟākal uṟaḻkalikku iyalpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_459">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_459">{SA TP459i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-150}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>āciriya+ pāṭṭiṉ aḷaviṟku ellai
<li>āyiram ākum iḻipu mūṉṟu aṭiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_460">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_460">{SA TP460i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-151}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>neṭuveṇpāṭṭē mun-nāl aṭittē
<li>kuṟuveṇpāṭṭiṉ aḷavu eḻu cīrē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_461">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_461">{SA TP461i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-152}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṅkata+ pāṭṭu aḷavu avaṟṟoṭu okkum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_462">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_462">{SA TP462i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-153}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaliveṇpāṭṭē kaikkiḷai+ ceyyuḷ
<li>ceviyaṟi vāyuṟai puṟanilai eṉṟu ivai
<li>toku nilai marapiṉ aṭi ila eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_463">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_463">{SA TP463i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-154}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>puṟanilai vāyuṟai ceviyaṟivuṟūu eṉa+
<li>tiṟanilai mūṉṟum tiṇṇitiṉ teriyiṉ
<li>veṇpā iyaliṉum āciriya iyaliṉum
<li>paṇpuṟa muṭiyum pāliṉa eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_464">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_464">{SA TP464i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-155}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>paripāṭallē,
<li>nāl-īr aimpatu uyarpu aṭi āka
<li>ai-aintu ākum iḻipu aṭikku ellai.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_465">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_465">{SA TP465i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-156}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aḷaviyal vakaiyē aṉai vakaippaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_466">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_466">{SA TP466i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-157}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḻu nilattu eḻunta ceyyuḷ teriyiṉ
<li>aṭi varai illaṉa āṟu eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_467">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_467">{SA TP467i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-158}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaitām,
<li>nūliṉāṉa uraiyiṉāṉa
<li>noṭiyoṭu puṇarnta piciyiṉāṉa
<li>ētu nutaliya mutumoḻiyāṉa
<li>maṟai moḻi kiḷanta mantirattāṉa
<li>kūṟṟu iṭai vaitta kuṟippiṉāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_468">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_468">{SA TP468i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-159}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṟṟuḷ,
<li>nūl eṉappaṭuvatu nuvalum kālai
<li>mutalum muṭivum māṟukōḷ iṉṟi
<li>tokaiyiṉum vakaiyiṉum poruṇmai kāṭṭi
<li>uḷ niṉṟu akaṉṟa uraiyoṭu puṇarntu
<li>nuṇṇitiṉ viḷakkal atu ataṉ paṇpē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_469">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_469">{SA TP469i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-160}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>atuvētāṉum oru nāl vakaittē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_470">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_470">{SA TP470i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-161}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru poruḷ nutaliya cūttirattāṉum
<li>iṉa moḻi kiḷanta ōttiṉāṉum
<li>potu moḻi kiḷanta paṭalattāṉum
<li>mūṉṟu uṟuppu aṭakkiya piṇṭattāṉum eṉṟu
<li>āṅku aṉai marapiṉ iyalum eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_471">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_471">{SA TP471i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-162}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>avaṟṟuḷ,
<li>cūttiram tāṉē
<li>āṭi niḻaliṉ aṟiya+ tōṉṟi
<li>nāṭutal iṉṟi+ poruḷ naṉi viḷaṅka
<li>yāppiṉuḷ tōṉṟa yāttu amaippatuvē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_472">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_472">{SA TP472i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-163}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nēr iṉa maṇiyai niralpaṭa vaittāṅku
<li>ōr iṉa+ poruḷai oru vaḻi vaippatu
<li>ōttu ena moḻipa uyarmoḻi+ pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_473">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_473">{SA TP473i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-164}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru neṟi iṉṟi viraviya poruḷāṉ
<li>potu moḻi toṭariṉ atu paṭalam ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_474">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_474">{SA TP474i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-165}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mūṉṟu uṟuppu aṭakkiya taṉmaittu āyiṉ
<li>tōṉṟu moḻi+ pulavar atu piṇṭam eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_475">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_475">{SA TP475i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-166}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāṭṭu iṭai vaitta kuṟippiṉāṉum
<li>pā iṉṟu eḻunta kiḷaviyāṉum
<li>poruḷ marapu illā+ poymmoḻiyāṉum
<li>poruḷoṭu puṇarnta nakaimoḻiyāṉum eṉṟu
<li>urai vakai naṭaiyē nāṉku eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_476">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_476">{SA TP476i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-167}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>atuvētāṉum iru vakaittu ākum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_477">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_477">{SA TP477i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-168}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oṉṟē maṟṟum cevilikku urittē
<li>oṉṟē yārkkum varai nilai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_478">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_478">{SA TP478i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-169}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oppoṭu puṇarnta uvamattāṉum
<li>tōṉṟuvatu kiḷanta tuṇiviṉāṉum
<li>eṉṟu iru vakaittē pici nilai vakaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_479">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_479">{SA TP479i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-170}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>nuṇmaiyum curukkamum oḷiyuṭaimaiyum
<li>eṇmaiyum eṉṟu ivai viḷaṅka+ tōṉṟi
<li>kuṟitta poruḷai muṭittaṟku varūum
<li>ētu nutaliya mutumoḻi eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_480">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_480">{SA TP480i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-171}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>niṟaimoḻi māntar āṇaiyiṉ kiḷakkum
<li>maṟaimoḻitāṉē mantiram eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_481">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_481">{SA TP481i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-172}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>eḻuttoṭum colloṭum puṇarātāki
<li>poruṭpuṟattatuvē kuṟippu moḻiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_482">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_482">{SA TP482i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-173}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāṭṭiṭai+ kalanta poruḷa āki
<li>pāṭṭiṉ iyala paṇṇattiyyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_483">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_483">{SA TP483i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-174}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>atuvētāṉum piciyoṭu māṉum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_484">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_484">{SA TP484i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-175}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>aṭi nimir kiḷavi īr-āṟu ākum
<li>aṭi ikantu variṉum kaṭi varai iṉṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_485">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_485">{SA TP485i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-176}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḷar iyal vakaiyiṉ kiḷantaṉa teriyiṉ
<li>aḷaviyal vakaiyē aṉai vakaippaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_486">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_486">{SA TP486i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-177}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kaikkiḷai mutalā ēḻ perun tiṇaiyum
<li>muṉ kiḷantaṉavē muṟaiyiṉāṉa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_487">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_487">{SA TP487i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-178}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kāma+ puṇarcciyum iṭam talaippaṭalum
<li>pāṅkoṭu taḻāalum tōḻiyiṉ puṇarvum eṉṟu
<li>āṅka nāl vakaiyiṉum aṭainta cārpoṭu
<li>maṟai eṉa moḻital maṟaiyōr āṟē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_488">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_488">{SA TP488i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-179}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṟai veḷippaṭutalum tamariṉ peṟutalum
<li>ivai mutalākiya iyal neṟi tiriyātu
<li>malivum pulaviyum ūṭalum uṇarvum
<li>pirivoṭu puṇarntatu kaṟpu eṉappaṭumē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_489">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_489">{SA TP489i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-180}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>mey peṟum avaiyē kaikōḷ vakaiyē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_490">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_490">{SA TP490i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-181}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pārppāṉ pāṅkaṉ tōḻi cevili
<li>cīrttaku ciṟappiṉ kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyoṭu
<li>aḷavu iyal marapiṉ aṟu vakaiyōrum
<li>kaḷaviṉ kiḷavikku uriyar eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_491">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_491">{SA TP491i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-182}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>pāṇaṉ kūttaṉ viṟali parattai
<li>āṇam cāṉṟa aṟivar kaṇṭōr
<li>pēṇutaku ciṟappiṉ pārppāṉ mutalā
<li>muṉṉuṟa+ kiḷanta aṟuvaroṭu tokaii
<li>tol neṟi marapiṉ kaṟpiṟku uriyar.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_492">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_492">{SA TP492i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-183}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ūrum ayalum cēriyōrum
<li>nōy maruṅku aṟinarum tantaiyum taṉṉaiyum
<li>koṇṭeṭuttu moḻiyappaṭutal allatu
<li>kūṟṟu avaṇ iṉmai yāppuṟa+ tōṉṟum.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_493">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_493">{SA TP493i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-184}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>kiḻavaṉtaṉṉoṭum kiḻattitaṉṉoṭum
<li>naṟṟāy kūṟal muṟṟa+ tōṉṟātu.
</ol>
<HR>

