<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_494">{SA TP494i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-185}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oṇ toṭi mātar kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyoṭu
<li>kaṇṭōr moḻital kaṇṭatu eṉpa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_495">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_495">{SA TP495i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-186}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṭaiccura maruṅkiṉ kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyoṭu
<li>vaḻakku* iyal āṇaiyiṉ kiḷattaṟku* um uriyaṉ
</ol>
<HR>

