<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_496">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_496">{SA TP496i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-187}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oḻintōr kiḷavi kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyoṭu
<li>moḻintāṅku uriyar muṉṉattiṉ eṭuttē.
</ol>
<HR>

