<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_497">{SA TP497i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-188}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>maṉaiyōḷ kiḷaviyum kiḻavaṉ kiḷaviyum
<li>niṉaiyum kālai kēṭkunar avarē.
</ol>
