<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_500">{SA TP500i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-191}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>vāyil ucāvē tammuḷ uriya.
</ol>
