<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_501">{SA TP501i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-192}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>ñāyiṟu tiṅkaḷ aṟivē nāṇē
<li>kaṭalē kāṉal vilaṅkē maraṉē
<li>pulampuṟu poḻutē puḷḷē neñcē
<li>avai ala piṟavum nutaliya neṟiyāṉ
<li>colluna pōlavum kēṭkuna pōlavum
<li>colliyāṅku amaiyum eṉmaṉār pulavar.
</ol>
<HR>

