<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_502">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_502">{SA TP502i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-193}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>oru neṟippaṭṭu āṅku ōr iyal muṭiyum
<li>karuma nikaḻcci iṭam eṉa moḻipa.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_503">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_503">{SA TP503i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-194}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iṟappē nikaḻvē etiratu eṉṉum
<li>tiṟattiyal maruṅkiṉ terintaṉar uṇara
<li>poruḷ nikaḻvu uraippatu kālam ākum.
</ol>
