<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_505">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_505">{SA TP505i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-196}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>uyttuṇarvu iṉṟi talaivaru poruṇmaiyiṉ
<li>mey+ paṭa muṭippatu meyppāṭu ākum.
