<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="ilam_por.htm#_TPi_508">{SA TP508i}</A>
<TD>{N ceyyu-199}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>iv iṭattu im moḻi ivar ivarkku uriya eṉṟu
<li>av iṭattu avar avarkku uraippatu muṉṉam.
</ol>
<HR>

