<li>kuṟaḷaṭi mutalā aintu aṭi oppittu
<li>ōṅkiya moḻiyāṉ āṅku avaṇ moḻiyiṉ
<li>iḻaipiṉ ilakkaṇam iyaintatākum.
</ol>
