<li>iḻaitta ilakkaṇam piḻaittaṉa pōla
<li>varuva uḷa eṉiṉum vantavaṟṟu iyalāṉ
<li>tiripu iṉṟi muṭittal teḷḷiyōr kaṭaṉē.
</ol>
<HR>

