<H2><A NAME="_TP9_">((9. marapu iyal))</A></H2>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_545">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="marapu.htm#_TPi_545">{SA TP545i}</A>
<TD>{N marap-01}
</TABLE>

<ol>
<li>māṟṟa arum^ ciṟappiṉ marapu iyal kiḷappiṉ
<li>pārppu* um paṟaḻ um kuṭṭi ~um kuruḷai ~um
<li>kaṉṟu* um piḷḷai ~um maka um maṟi ~um eṉṟu
<li>oṉpatu* um kuḻaviyoṭu iḷamai+ peyar ē.
</ol>
<HR>

<TABLE>
<TR>
<TD><A NAME="_TP_546">##</A>
<TD><A TARGET="Right" HREF="marapu.htm#_TPi_546">{SA TP546i}</A>
